<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="ROM" style="id">- Onobasulu Translation</book>
  <para style="h">Lome</para>
  <para style="toc1">Folohe Lome Sesefea Sowi Ewe Selefia Mebailu</para>
  <para style="toc2">Lome</para>
  <para style="toc3">Lom</para>
  <para style="rem">First draft Yobe, Joseph Johann; June 2017 Ch1- 8, Feb 2018, Ch 9-16, Wabele, Jack and Johann</para>
  <para style="rem">Advisor Check Yobe, Joseph, Anne, March 2019</para>
  <para style="rem">VE by Anne</para>
  <para style="rem">CC By Duncan Kasokason in Walagu Village, Hans Beukers present as secretary. November 2022</para>
  <para style="mt">Lome</para>
  <para style="mt2">Folohe Lome Sesefea</para>
  <para style="mt2">Sowi Ewe Selefia Mebailu</para>
  <para style="imt">Sulu samini alegaeyo</para>
  <para style="ip">Folohe sowi ewe selelu maumo, ehe keliso mosomu noolo Lome sidi bule ami labe amone babiyo maiyo hilisefia solu. E-mo, ilidai fogo bilale miliyo maiyo hamefia, dufia e hele bule Sefeini ami, awalu sulu nafulu saeyo maiyo hiliselu. Sowi selelu ewemo, Folohe Kelisone awalu sulu nafulu amone, sawaba dafa koleba solu. Aufia, idele inolo Yesu kuliba abia mololo amone mana, amoda ehe sowi ewe usu sulu selelu.</para>
  <para style="ip">Folohe sowi ewe seleyo maugasiamo, ehe Lomene keliso idele inolofea henelu sulu solu. Aufia, e selesia, ehe Godedai sulu selesiamo, Godehe ili sagoba homesine sulu selaba loluba solu. Aufia dufia, ehe sulu ewene maumo fadaba solu. Asigi ule ofelefe eno amosu alefasia, nini Godene si saabia isolu idele inolo holobagalo. (Lome 1.17) Folo selesia, “Hama, ili Yuda mosomunagada, me yau mosomunagada, idele inolo suniahe wolusu mololo. Aulugulu, ene kiwi amofea alefasia, Godedai isolu miliyone, inolo uleno male koleba. Aubale. Godene kanululo ulu melu amosu alefasia, Ehe nini Edai isoba moloba ofolo. Idele inolo Yesu Kelisofea asigi ule ofelefemo, Godehe ili obegeba difasia, ilimo Godene damene adesia, Yesu Kelisone elewodali, enanodali, alebailo. (Lalolu 1-4)</para>
  <para style="ip">Aulugulu, Godehe inolo uleno gasiba dafelagoba obegeba disenaga, amo ene miliyolumo hili holobagalo. Auba hili holobagalo inolo e-mo Gode galiba adesi, Godene Asubane Noekenemo efea wasigaalo. Ausi, woludai, olalodai amohe, saabia no e dufa dafogoyofia, e yasifia uluba miliyomo kiwidale miliyobafe.” Lalolu 5-8 amimo, Folohe Godene sulu muguli amone mau amone walefe. Aufia, e walesia, Asubane Noekenene kiwigagalu amone walefe.</para>
  <para style="ip">Lalolu 9-11 amimo, Folohe ene higinilu uleno awafe. Folo ene e-mo, Yuda mosomu inolo labe. Amo samini waagi, Gode alefasia, Yuda mosomu amo, Ene mosomu idele inoloba iminiba ufulu koleba. Auluso, Yuda mosomu bule noolomo, Yesufea faiso melu. Yau idele inolo wedinale noolomo, Yesune kuliba sibaisalo alolu. Auluso, Yuda ili auba adale alolu. Folo selesia, amo Yuda ine heleba mololuba solu. Ili alefasia, Godehe kegele bule ilifea moloyo hameluso, ili diyo habolu. Auluso, Folo hilisesia, dufia Yuda mosomu idele inolo ilida, Yesune mosomu usu miliyo suga miyobafeba hiliselu.</para>
  <para style="ip">Sowi ewene haisi afelesia, selesiamo, Folohe keliso idele inolo ilihe mana ewe koleba kuliba malesi selefe. (Lalolu 12-15) Ehe noolo anogo koleba hameseyone mana amone wedinale selefe. Aufia, ehe Godene dabalu moloyone mana amoda selesia, gamane sisa miliyone mana amoda selesia, aufia noolo anogo sagoba ufiyone mana amoneda selefe.</para>
  <para style="ip">Lalolu 16 ami, Folohe idele inolo noolofea hawiyoba selefe.</para>
  <para style="ip">
    <figure style="fig" alt="Separator Artwork for the Onobasulu NT - Waves" file="Separator1Onobasulu.tiff" size="span" loc="Between Book entry and text of the NT" copy="Johann Alberts, based on Onobasulu artwork" ref="1.0" /></para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="ROM 1" />
  <para style="s">Folohe ene hilibaisi daalu dabalu mololo amone solu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 1:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1.1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 9:15">HD 9.15</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Na <char style="w">Folo</char>, na <char style="w">Keliso</char> Yesu Ene <char style="w" lemma="Balu dabalu moloba ofolo faibe">balu dabalu mololo inolo</char> lolu. Ehe na welumo, <char style="w" lemma="Hilibaisi daalu inolo">hilibaisi daalu</char> amone melesi welu. Aufia, Ehe na Godene awalu sulu nafulu amone samesine iminifia gadefalu.<verse eid="ROM 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 1:2" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1.2 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ROM 16:25-26">Lom 16.25-26</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Samini waagi, Godehe Ene <char style="w">saaba ofolo</char> inolofeafia, awalu sulu nafulu amo oloba huliale saaba ufulu. Ausi, ninihe saaba ufulu sulu amo, Godene bugo usu alegaeyodolu lolu. <verse eid="ROM 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 1:3" />Sulu nafulu ewemo, Ene Faibe amone ulufaba walelu. Helefealune domala manafealomo, E, kini <char style="w" lemma="Deibidi">Deibidine</char> saladegelune ibifeafia holobagalu. <verse eid="ROM 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 1:4" />Aufia, <char style="w" lemma="Asubane Noekene">Asubane Noekenene</char> manafealomo, E olaiya amifia degelu amohe, E Godene Faibe kiwigagaluda labeba iminifia gadefalu. E, Yesu Keliso, nine <char style="w">Saminilo</char> koleba labe.<figure style="fig" alt="Open grave" file="GT00088.tif" size="col" copy="Gordon Thompson (WBT)" ref="1.4">Yesu Keliso olaiya amifia degelu labe.</figure> <verse eid="ROM 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 1:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 26:16-18">HD 26.16-18</ref>; <ref loc="GAL 2:7-9">Gal 2.7-9</ref></char></note>Ehe nini kanuluba ofelesia, Ene hilibaisi daalu dabalu molomesine iminiba ufulu. E auba mololumo, yau idele inolo mosomu sunia Yesufea <char style="w" lemma="Asigi ule ufulu">asigi ule ofasia</char>, E sisa adesia, Ene sulu dobelesia kuliba milesifia, aulu. <verse eid="ROM 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 1:6" />Aufia, Godehe gili welumo, gilida Yesu Keliso Ene mosomu labe aleba ami melesi gadefalu.<verse eid="ROM 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 1:7" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1.7 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="NUM 6:25-26">Nam 6.25-26</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Sowi ewe, nahe sigidubulu idele inolo Lome ami alebaibu gili amofea seleba mesu. Godehe gili hamesesia welumo, <char style="w" lemma="Godedai muuba kalilu idele inolo">Ene idele inolo noekene muuba kalilu</char> melesi, ama iminiba ufulu.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="ROM 1:7" />
  <para style="p" vid="ROM 1:7">Nine Nao Godedai, Saminilo Yesu Kelisodaihe, gilifea kanuluba ofelesia, gine asigine libo esebalo gadaeaba melesi moloyobafe.<verse eid="ROM 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Folohe Lome ili babiyo hamelu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 1:8" />Maugaba, na gilifea saeyo hamefemo, ewe. Helefealu idele inolo suniahe, gine <char style="w">asigi ule ufulu</char> kolelu dobu ogone saaba sigife. Aulugulu, na iwi ligia, nahe gili sunia hilisesia, Yesu Kelisone wi alefasia, ne Godefea henesu. <verse eid="ROM 1:8" /><verse number="9-10" style="v" sid="ROM 1:9-10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.9-10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 19:21">HD 19.21</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 15:23">Lom 15.23</ref></char></note>Nahe Gode Ene Faibene awalu sulu nafulu waleba ligiamo, Ene dabalu kolelu molosu. Aufia, hilia sunia nahe gili asigisia, <char style="w" lemma="Godedai sulu selefe">Edai sulu selaba</char> loluba, Gode Eda auba asigifia labe. Na auba Edai sulu selaba ligiamo, Ene hame adesenaga, Na gili wakaliyo malesine, eno sogoba homesi susiba selesu.<verse eid="ROM 1:9-10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 1:11" />Na koleba gilimo babaiyeba hamefe, maumo, na alefasia, Asubane Noekenene ulu kegele noolo, gine asubane kiwigaaba homesine, na gilifea meyo hamefe. <verse eid="ROM 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 1:12" />Na asigibumo ewe. Nini ua adesiamo, gine asigi ule ufulu ogohe, na kiwigaaba ofelesi, aufia na asigi ule ufulu ewehe, gilida kiwigaaba ufiyone selesu.<verse eid="ROM 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 1:13" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1.13 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 19:21">HD 19.21</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Ne damenedali, gili nafuluba asigima. Nahe <char style="w" lemma="Yau idele inolo - Yau mosomu">yau idele inolo</char> nolobalo aleba ami, sebe helemesi mololugulu, nahe gili aleba amida, auba moloyo hamefe. Gili labea miyone, na fogo wedinale daiyalu. Auluso, hilia sunia kegele nokene nokeneba holobagafe ewehe, na kaaso.<verse eid="ROM 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 1:14" />Idele inolo Giligi mosomuda, Giligi mosomualeda, sidi kakainabufealoda, idele inolo ilosisa kakainabufealoda, aufia idele inolo dawalolo dulufealoda, idele inolo dawalolo dulualefealoda, ili sagoba homesine, Godehe dabalu amo nafea melu. Aulugulu, dabalu amo na moloyo dobu. <verse eid="ROM 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 1:15" />Amo alefasia, Lome kakainabu idele inolo gilifeada, awalu sulu nafulu amo waleyomone, na mesegelu bule koleba adesu.<verse eid="ROM 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Awalu sulu nafulumo, Godene kiwi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 1:16" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1.16 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MRK 8:38">Mag 8.38</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 1:18-24">1Kld 1.18-24</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 13:46">HD 13.46</ref></char>
    </note>Na Godene awalu sulu nafulu amofea yuasiale, ami kalugaasu, maumo, Godene kiwigagalumo sulu amofea dobu. Kiwigagalu amofea alefasia, <char style="w">asigi ule ufulu</char> idele inolomo <char style="w" lemma="Gasiba dafelagoba dilo">gasiba dafelagoba</char> obegeba dilo. <char style="w">Yuda</char> idele inolo, ilidale gasiba dafelagoba difasia, yau idele inolo ilida, gasiba dafelagoba diyobafe. <verse eid="ROM 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 1:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HAB 2:4">Hab 2.4</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 3:21-22">Lom 3.21-22</ref></char></note>Awalu sulu nafulu ewehe ninifea ulufaba walesia, <char style="w">asigi ule ufulu</char> eno amofeasu alefasia, nini Godene si saabia isolu idele inolo miliyobafe. Aubamo, Godene bugo eweguba selelu dobu. <char style="qt">“Asigi ule ufulu eno amofea alefasia, inolo isolu moloba ufulu adesi, e bebea miliyobafe.”</char><verse eid="ROM 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Idele inolo suniahe Godefea faiso meba yaafe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 1:18" />Helefealu idele inolo Godefea faiso mefia, wolu moloba ligia, ine mana isoluale amo alefasia, ilihe sulu sealemo dufa egefe. Godene gadilomo <char style="w" lemma="Hebene">hebenefia</char> suga inigia, ine mana wolu amo dobia ami ulufaba walefe. <verse eid="ROM 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 1:19" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 14:15-17">HD 14.15-17</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 17:24-28">17.24-28</ref></char></note>Ilihe Gode dawaloyodolu alebaibu, maumo, Gode Ehe Ene mana ilifea walelo. <verse eid="ROM 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 1:20" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 12:7-9">Jop 12.7-9</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 19:1">Sng 19.1</ref></char></note>Inolohe Gode bolale. Auluso, helefealu moloiya amifia, kegele E mololumo, idele inolo suniahe bolo. Aulune, asigida alebaibu ili suniahe, Godene kiwigagalu bolo. Ene kiwigagalu asigilelale. Amo bisigia, ilihe Gode labebuba asigiyodolu alebaibu. Aulugulu, ilihe laloba uleno saeyo male.<verse eid="ROM 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 1:21" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1.21 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EPH 4:17-18">Efe 4.17-18</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Ili Gode fadaba asigibuso, ilihe Ene wi digiba selesia, Efea wisoba sodale. Ine asigimo, eleda male ligia, aufia ine libomo, dabagalalu ligia, nigiligagalu alebaibu. <verse eid="ROM 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 1:22" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 10:14">Jer 10.14</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 1:20">1Kld 1.20</ref></char></note>Ili ine meleba eleliba selesiamo, ili asigida duluba kaiiba sodo alebaibuso, ine asigimo elawanefia alebaibu. <verse eid="ROM 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 1:23" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 4:15-19">Lo 4.15-19</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 106:20">Sng 106.20</ref></char></note>Gulugululofealomo, ilihe olalale Godene <char style="w" lemma="Elalelu">elalelumo</char> afelesia, olalo kegele amofea bedosia, inoloda, hagada, kelebuluda, aufia koanoda, kegele amone mimisililu moloba waalefia, ili amofea gulugululo.<verse eid="ROM 1:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Idele inolohe mana wolu nokene nokeneba mololo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 1:24" />Aulugulu, Godehe idele inolo wolu waagi molomesi gadefasi, ine wolu molobaiyesia mesegelo amohe, ilimo susugu mana amo uluba adesi, ilihe ine domala weasesia, mana wolu nokene nokeneba noolodai moloba ado. <verse eid="ROM 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 1:25" />Ilihe Godene sulu seale amo afelesia, masega sulu bedoba disia, amone sigiba dubulu. Ili alefalu Godehe kegele suniada mololu amofea guluguluyo amo afasia, alefalale mololu kegele amofea ili guluguluba ado. Auluso, ninihe hilia sunia Gode Ene wi digiba selaba miliyoba. <char style="sls"><char style="w">Amen</char>.</char> Amo seale koleba.<verse eid="ROM 1:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 1:26" />Ili auba bedoba mololugulu, Godehe ili ine yuasiale susugu mana mololo amone kuliba malesi waagi gadefalu. Idele ilimo, inolodai adomone mana afasia, ine geleba susugu moloba ado. <verse eid="ROM 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 1:27" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 18:22">Wkp 18.22</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 20:13">20.13</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 6:9">1Kld 6.9</ref></char></note>Aubasu molosiamo, inolo ilida, idodai ado mana amo afasia, ine libo de-gulu waiya degesia, ine geleba molosia, ibolo melo. Idele inolo ilihe, yualu mana auba molosiamo, ine heleba mololu amone elebe wolu disi, ine domalafea holobagafe.<verse eid="ROM 1:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 1:28" />Auba mololabia abiamo, Gode dawaloyomo eledale kegeleba hilisesia, ilihe E-mo afelesi, Godehe ine mana eleda male amohe ili uluba melesi, waagi gadefalu. Aulune, ilihe mololale mana amone mololabia dedaleba ado. <verse eid="ROM 1:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 1:29" />Ilihe isoluale mana moloyomo wasigasia, mana wolu nokene nokeneba mololomo ewe. Henanene manada, mesegelo manada, gisa ado manada, none kegele sigilo manada, ilifea wasigafia labe. Wolu noolo ilifea wasigafia labemo ewe. Nofea woba hiliseloda, inolo no dufa olaloda, gadiba yaaloda, inolo no masega gegeloda, inolo no anogofea woba haboba hiliseloda, mana amo sunia ilifea wasigafia labe. Ilihe no anogone bado geleba sododa, <verse eid="ROM 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 1:30" />noolo anogo woba dafa sododa, Godefea gogoloba sododa, noolofea sulu halaleba sododa, elelifia bamabamaba yaasia, ine wi digiba yaalo. Ilihe wolu hili moloyone, eno isaba yaalo. Aufia, ilimo enaodai, enaedaine sulu saidafolo. <verse eid="ROM 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 1:31" />Ili amo ine asigi dabagalaba ado. Ili amohe ine sulu saaba ufulumo, kuliba anale. Ili amohe no anogo hamesebale ado. Ili amohe inolo no anogo yagu nagalale. <verse eid="ROM 1:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ROM 1:32" />Godene sulu muguli selesia, idele inolo mana amogulu molofe ili amo, dufa olaeyo dobuba saaba ufulu. Idele inolo suniahe amo asigibuso, ili amo aso mololabiasu dedaleba labe. Amosuale, ilihe inolo noolo wolu amogulu molofe amoda molomesi eesia, molofe ine wi digilo.<verse eid="ROM 1:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="ROM 2" />
  <para style="s">Godehe fadaasiamo, E isoba fadaalo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 2:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2.1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 7:1-2">Mad 7.1-2</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 8:7">Yon 8.7</ref></char>
    </note>Aulugulu, gahe inolo noolo wolu auba molosi osolafemo, gene gada elaloba sulu saeyo male koleba. Gahe nofea “Ga wolu mololusia” osolaba dafalisenaga, amo ga gene melebafeada mololusia osolaba dafalife. Mau enebamo, gene gada, mana ili mololo aubasu mololo. <verse eid="ROM 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 2:2" />Nini hilisesiamo, Godehe idele inolo mana wolu ewegulu molofe amone fadaasiamo, Ehe Ene seale sulu sodo amo alefasia, isoba osolaeyobafe. <verse eid="ROM 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 2:3" />Gahe idele inolo noolo osolafe ogomo, gene gada, mana amogulu moloba labegulu, Godehe idele inolo osolasimo, ga Gode osolafe amo elaba daafia maiyoba hilisefela? <verse eid="ROM 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 2:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 1:7">Efe 1.7</ref>; <ref loc="2PE 3:15">2Fid 3.15</ref></char></note>Gode E-mo, idele inolo hamesesiamo, hamedofa ligia, yasiba labe. Auluso, gahe E auba yasibu amo golaba besabebu. Gode Ehe, ga <char style="w" lemma="Asigi besiyo">asigi besimesisia</char>, gafea hamesefia labe. Aufebamo, ga asigifalebu.<verse eid="ROM 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 2:5" />Auluso, ga asigi kolelusu adesia, ga asigi besiyale hamefe. Mana amofea alefasia, gahe elebe wolu bule sabe diyomo, wedinale dauna galabia felafe. Ausi, Godehe isoba fadaafe hiliamo, Ene kanolomo ulufa holobagasi, elebe wolu ga diyobafemo, bule koleba miliyobafe. <verse eid="ROM 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 2:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 62:12">Sng 62.12</ref>; <ref loc="PRO 24:12">Snd 24.12</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 16:27">Mad 16.27</ref>; <ref loc="2CO 5:10">2Kld 5.10</ref></char></note>Godehe <char style="qt">idele inolo mana elebi elebiba moloba alolu amoguba, sabe elebe meyobafe.</char> <verse eid="ROM 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 2:7" />Godehe idele inolofea auba sabe elebe mesiamo, Ehe idele inolo ewegulufea <char style="w">miliyolu miliyo</char> meyobafe. Idele inolo abehe, Godehe ine wi digimesisia, Ehe ilifea <char style="w">elalelu</char> memesifia, olaeyale amone diyone migagaba isaba ligia, hilia sunia mana nafulusu moloba adefe, ili amofea Godehe miliyolu miliyo meyobafe. <verse eid="ROM 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 2:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2TH 1:8">2Des 1.8</ref></char></note>Auluso, idele inolo abehe asigume adesia, ine hamefeguba kuliba daaba ligia, sulu seale sodomo golaba baafia, saidafelesia, mana isoluale kuliba aafe, ili amofea gadilodai, kanolodai, ufia miliyobafe. <verse eid="ROM 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 2:9" />Higiniludai, nagadai, amohe dedeleba sesia, idele inolo mana woluda moloba labe ili amofea holobagaeyobafe. Higinilu amo <char style="w">Yuda</char> idele inolo ilifeadale holobagafia, aufia yau idele inolo ilifeada, aubasu holobagaeyobafe. <verse eid="ROM 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 2:10" />Auluso, elaleluda, wi buleda, <char style="w" lemma="Aealo - Aeaba Ofolo">aealoda</char>, amomo, idele inolo mana nafulusu molosia alebaibu, ili amofea holobagaeyobafe. Amomo, Yuda idele inolo ilifeadale holobagaeyobafe. Aufia, yau idele inolo ilifeada, aubasu holobagaeyobafe. <verse eid="ROM 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 2:11" />Enebamo, Godehe idele inolo osolasiamo, misi bisigiale, mana imini ule aiba osolalo.<verse eid="ROM 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 2:12" />Yau mosomu idele inolo <char style="w" lemma="Muguli">mugulida</char> male ligia, wolu molofe amo, ili sunia, mugulida male ligia, woba dafiyobafe. Auluso, Yuda mosomu idele inolo mugulida ufiya ligia, wolu mana molofe ili amo sunia, sulu muguli solu dobu amohe, ine manamo osolaeyobafe. <verse eid="ROM 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 2:13" />Idele inolo sulu muguli balu dobolo ili amo, Godene si saabia isolu miliyobafale. Aubale. Idele inolo sulu mugulida kuliba aafe, ili amosu, <char style="w" lemma="Godedai isoba melesi moloba ofolo">Godene si saabia isolu miliyobafe</char>. <verse eid="ROM 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 2:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 10:35">HD 10.35</ref></char></note><char style="w" lemma="Yau idele inolo - Yau mosomu">Yau mosomu</char> idele inolo, ili Mosesene muguli suluda male. Auluso, ili ogo seale muguli sulu malenagada, ine asigine hamehe, muguli mana selelu dobuguba kuliba daaba molosenaga, amohe walesia, muguli sulu amo ine libofea dobuba walefe. <verse eid="ROM 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 2:15" />Maumo, hilia noolomo, ine <char style="w" lemma="Asigi nafulune si">asigi nafulune sihe</char> ine ili fadaasia, selesia, ili mana wolu mololuba selesenaga, ili yualo. Auluso, hilia noolomo, ine asigi nafulune sihe ine ili fadaasia selesia, ili mana nafulu mololuba sububa selesenaga, ili henelo. Ine mana mololu amofea alefasia, Godene muguli sulumo ine libo usu seleba ufulububa ulufaba walefe. <verse eid="ROM 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 2:16" />Godehe Yesu <char style="w" lemma="Keliso">Kelisofea</char> alefasia, idele inolo ine muguba ufulu mana osolafe hiliamo, auba ulufaba waleyobafe. Awalu sulu nafulu, na walelo amohe, auba selefe.<verse eid="ROM 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yuda ili hilisesia, sulu mugulihe ilifea sagoba ufiyobafeba hiliselo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 2:17" />Sowi eweda alegafe amo, gene meleba “Na <char style="w">Yuda</char> inolo loluba” sodomo, ga bamabamasia, eweguba hiliselobu. “Yuda mosomu uleno, na lolu. Aufia, na Mosesene <char style="w">muguli</char> sulu saabia kalugaafia lolu. Aufia na-mo, Gode hagoaleba lolusia, Ene mosomu lolune kaiiba lolu. <verse eid="ROM 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 2:18" />Aufia na-mo, Ene hamemo asigifia lolu. Aufia, muguli suluhe na walelugulu, na dawalofia lolu. Mau amofea alefasia, nahe isolu manamo nafuluba osolaba bolo lolu. <verse eid="ROM 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 2:19" />Aufia, si kalalu ilifea eno walelomo, na lolu. Aufia, idele inolo nigiligagalu dobia alebaibu amone yanemo, na lolu. <verse eid="ROM 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 2:20" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2TI 3:5">2Dim 3.5</ref></char></note>Aufia, idele inolo asigida male amone walelomo, na lolu. Aufia, faibe deseine amone walelomo, na lolu. Enebamo, na muguli sunia dawaloba dulu ligia, seale sulu sodomo dulu inolo lolu.” <verse eid="ROM 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 2:21" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 23:3-4">Mad 23.3-4</ref></char></note>Ga gene meleba auba asigisia, idele inolo nooloda waleba adomo, gahe gene meleba waleluale ogo, mau ene? Ga abehe noolofea “Fa dimabiyoba” waleba selaba adomo, gene gada, fa dilalela?<verse eid="ROM 2:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 2:22" />Ga abehe noolofea “Susugu mana molomabiyoba” waleba selaba adomo, gene gada, susugu mololalela? Ga <char style="w">masega gode</char> hamelaleba sodo. Auluso, gene gahe masega godene gulugululo molo usu kegele dobumo, fa dilalela? <verse eid="ROM 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 2:23" />Ga abehe, gene meleba bamabamasia, “Na Mosesene muguli sulu saabia kalugaafia loluba” selaba adomo, gene gahe muguli sulu amo gelesia, Godene wimo woba ofolobu. <verse eid="ROM 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 2:24" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 52:5">Ais 52.5</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 36:22">Ese 36.22</ref></char></note>Godene bugohe amone iminisia, sulu eweguba selelu dobu. <char style="qt">Yuda gilihe muguli sulu gelefe amone bafasia, <char style="w" lemma="Yau idele inolo - Yau mosomu">yau idele inolo</char> ili aleba amimo, Godene wimo gaidabosia, dufa dafogoba selefe.</char><verse eid="ROM 2:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bado amaleba gelelo amone mana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 2:25" />Yuda inolo, ga Mosesene sulu <char style="w">muguli</char> kuliba aasenaga, amo ge <char style="w" lemma="Bado amaleba gelelo mana">bado amaleba gelelu</char> amone eleda dobu. Auluso, ga sulu muguli gelesenaga, ga bado amaleba gelelu amo eleda male adesi, ga yau inologulu adefe. <verse eid="ROM 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 2:26" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GAL 5:6">Gal 5.6</ref></char></note>Aulugulu, yau inolo uleno, ene badoda amaleba geleluale amohe, sulu muguline mana dobuguba nafuluba kuliba aasenaga, amo e inolo ene badoda amaleba gelelugulu adefe. <verse eid="ROM 2:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 2:27" />Seale, Yuda, ga muguli sulu selelu bugomo sefia ligia, gine bado amaleba gelelu labe. Auluso, ga sulu muguli amo gelesenaga, amo ewe holobagaeyobafe. Yau inolo, domalafealomo, seale e bado amaleba gelelualeso, ehe molomaleba solu sulu kuliba aafemo, ehe ga fadaafia, osolaba dafiyobafe.<verse eid="ROM 2:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 2:28" />Aulugulu, inolo bado saabianesu <char style="w">Yuda</char> adesenaga, amo Yuda sealeale. Enebamo, bado amaleba gelelo mana amo, domalanesuale. <verse eid="ROM 2:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 2:29" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 30:6">Lo 30.6</ref>; <ref loc="COL 2:11">Kol 2.11</ref></char></note>Aubale. Inolo ene libo usu Yuda adefemo, e seale Yuda inolo ado. Aufia, bado amaleba gelelo mana seale amo, inolone libo usu iligi moloyo dobu. Amomo, bugo selelu dobu kuliba aafe amofea alefasia mololale. Aubale. Amomo, Godene Asubane Noekene Ene alefasia mololo. Inolo amogulumo, inolone si saabiamo, e wida adale. Auluso, Godene si saabiamo, e wida ado.<verse eid="ROM 2:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="ROM 3" />
  <para style="s">Gode E isolu koleba labe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 3:1" />Auba selefe dofasia, ga eweguba hiliseyobafebile. <char style="w">Yuda</char> mosomu usu ado amohe, mosomu noolo usu adomo aso wasolula? Aufia, <char style="w" lemma="Bado amaleba gelelo mana">bado amaleba geleyo</char> mana amone, elemo hala? <verse eid="ROM 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 3:2" />Ee, amo ele nafulu koleba dobu. Gode alefasia, kegele nafulu nokene nokeneba Yuda ilifea melu. Olaibomo ewe. Godehe Ene sulu Yuda ilifea melumo, ilihe sulu amo luba melesi melu.<verse eid="ROM 3:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 3:3" />Auluso, Yuda idele inolo noolo ilihe sulu amo afelesia, <char style="w" lemma="Asigi ule ufulu">asigi ule ufulualemo</char>, eneba moloyobafe? Mana amofea alefasia, Gode Eda Ene sulu saaba ufulumo afiyobafebile? <verse eid="ROM 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 3:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 51:4">Sng 51.4</ref></char></note>Auba auyobafale koleba! Enebamo, idele inolo sunia ilihe masega sulu sodoso, Gode E-mo seale sulusu sodo. Godene Bugohe amone iminisia, eweguba selelu dobu.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="ROM 3:4" />
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 3:4">“<char style="qt">Gode, Ga seale isoluba sodomo, sulu Gene Ga selefe ogohe auba waleba ado.</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 3:4">
    <char style="qt">Inolohe Ga osolafeiyamo, ehe Ga seyodoluale adesi, Ga kaamo miliyobafe.</char>”<verse eid="ROM 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 3:5" />Amo eneba? Mana isoluale nini molosu ewehe, Gode E isolusu labeba ulufaba walesenaga, amo nini eneba saeyo? Nini helefealu inolo sodoguba, eweguba saeyobile? “Nini isoluale mana molofe amofea alefasia, nini auba gelebaisia sugasimo, nolobalo Godene isolu manafealomo felafe. Amohe walesiamo, E isolusu labeba ulufaba walefe. E nine mana amofea alefasia, E ana felafegulu, E nini osolaba dafalisenaga, E heleba asigisia, isoluale sabefeba” saeyobile? <verse eid="ROM 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 3:6" />Auba saeyale koleba. Gode E isolualebiaga, amo Ehe helefealu idele inolo eneba osolabaiyo?<verse eid="ROM 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 3:7" />Me nini eweguba saeyobile? “Masega sulu na selesu ewehe, Godene sulu sealemo saabia ulufaba koleba walesi, E ana felasenaga, mau enene, E aso na fadaasia osolaba dafalife?” <verse eid="ROM 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 3:8" />Wae, nini eweguba saeyobile? “Ninihe mana wolu waagi moloba miliyoba. Eno amofea alefasia, Gode ana felasi, nafulu mana holobagaeyobafebu.” Auba saeyale koleba. Auluso, inolo noolohe na woba dafa selesia, na sulu amogulu walelubiyoba masega solu. Ine woba dafa sulu solu amone sabe fadaasenaga, amo isolu koleba.<verse eid="ROM 3:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Helefealu idele inolo isolu uleno male</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 3:9" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3.9 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ROM 1:18-2:24">Lom 1.18–2.24</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 3:23">3.23</ref></char>
    </note>Ninihe eneba saaba samodoyobi? <char style="w">Yuda</char> mosomu ilihe yau mosomumo wasolula? Auba male. Samini na ama solu, auba saabia selesu. Nini Yuda idele inoloda, yau idele inoloda, <char style="w" lemma="Wolu / Wolu mololo">wolune</char> kiwigagaluhe nini sunia gasiaba samodobu. <verse eid="ROM 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 3:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.10-12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 14:1-3">Sng 14.1-3</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 53:1-3">53.1-3</ref>; <ref loc="ECC 7:20">Sav 7.20</ref></char></note>Amone iminisia, Godene bugohe eweguba selelu dobu.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="ROM 3:10" />
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 3:10">
    <char style="qt">“Godene si saabiamo, isolu idele inolo uleno male koleba.</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 3:10">
    <char style="qt">Seale, isolu inolo ulenoda male koleba.</char><verse eid="ROM 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 3:11" />
    <char style="qt">Asigida ufulu uleno male koleba.</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 3:11">
    <char style="qt">Godeda isafemo, inolo uleno male koleba.</char><verse eid="ROM 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 3:12" />
    <char style="qt">Idele inolo ili suniahe, Godefea faiso mefia, nolobalo daafia ligia, ili eleda male alolu alebaibu.</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 3:12">
    <char style="qt">Mana nafulu mololo inolo ulenoda, male koleba.”</char><verse eid="ROM 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 3:13" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3.13 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 5:9">Sng 5.9</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 140:3">140.3</ref></char>
    </note>
    <char style="qt">“Ine mofeyomo balilu dana sogolugulu besabe.</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 3:13">
    <char style="qt">Ine eanehe masega sulu sodo.”</char></para>
  <para style="b" vid="ROM 3:13" />
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 3:13">
    <char style="qt">“Soiye aiyanene hano wolumo, ine mofeyo gafo saabia dobu.”</char><verse eid="ROM 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 3:14" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3.14 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 10:7">Sng 10.7</ref>
      </char>
    </note>
    <char style="qt">“Ine mofeyomo kabilu wasigafia, no anogo kanoba woba ufiyone sulu saeyo wasigaabu.”</char><verse eid="ROM 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 3:15" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3.15-17 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 59:7-8">Ais 59.7-8</ref>
      </char>
    </note>
    <char style="qt">“Ili no anogone ibi sagaeyone, alebale naguba ano.</char><verse eid="ROM 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 3:16" />
    <char style="qt">Woba dafelesia, higinilu meba yaalu bolomo, ine emo emelalu buugulu ado.</char><verse eid="ROM 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 3:17" />
    <char style="qt">Ili amo noolodai <char style="w" lemma="Aealo - Aeaba Ofolo">aeaba</char> esebalo nafuluba misiyo eno amo, fadaba asigilale.”</char><verse eid="ROM 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 3:18" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3.18 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 36:1">Sng 36.1</ref>
      </char>
    </note>
    <char style="qt">“Ili amo Gode baaba sagilisialene, E sisa ami alebaibuale.”</char><verse eid="ROM 3:18" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 3:19" />Nini eweguba asigibu. Godene <char style="w">muguli</char> sulu selesiamo, Yuda idele inolo muguli amone sisada alebaibu ili amofea selefe. Auluso, helefealu idele inolo sunia, ilimo Godene si saabia heleba daalu alebaibu. Ausi, Yuda idele inoloda, yau idele inoloda, ili sunia elaloba sulu saeyo male adesi, Godehe ilifea saumaba saeyobafe. <verse eid="ROM 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 3:20" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 143:2">Sng 143.2</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 7:7">Lom 7.7</ref>; <ref loc="GAL 2:16">Gal 2.16</ref></char></note>Aulugulu, muguli mana kuliba aafe eno amo alefasia, inolo uleno <char style="w" lemma="Godedai isoba melesi moloba ofolo">Godene si saabia isolu</char> miliyobafale. Aubale. Muguli alefasia, nine wolumo ninifea fisigaba walelo.<verse eid="ROM 3:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Asigi ule ufulu amofeasu alefasia, ga isolu holobagabu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 3:21" />Auluso, agamo, Godehe eno hili no, nini Ene si saabia isolu melesi, ulufaba walefe. Samini, <char style="w">muguli</char> selelu amodai, <char style="w">saaba ofolo</char> ili sulu selelu amodaihe, eno hili amone walesia, ama selelu dobu. <verse eid="ROM 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 3:22" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GAL 2:16">Gal 2.16</ref></char></note>Eno hili amo ewe. Nini Yesu <char style="w" lemma="Keliso">Kelisofea</char> <char style="w" lemma="Asigi ule ufulu">asigi ule ofelesimo</char>, Gode Ehe ninimo Ene si saabia isolu koleba melesi, moloba ufiyobafe. Godehe ga inolo amoguluba iminiba bisigiale, eno ule amosu kuliba maiyobafe. <verse eid="ROM 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 3:23" />Mau enebamo, idele inolo nini sunia wolu molologulu, Gode Ene <char style="w">elalelu</char> mana, Ene waagulu holobagafia miliyonemo, nini abobolu koleba alebaibu. <verse eid="ROM 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 3:24" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 5:1">Lom 5.1</ref></char></note>Auluso, Gode Ene <char style="w">kanululo</char> amo ninifea balu ulu mesimo, Keliso Yesuhe nini elegefia, sububa dafelagolu. Eno amo alefasia, Godehe ninimo <char style="w" lemma="Godedai isoba melesi moloba ofolo">Ene si saabia isolu melesi moloba ofelefe</char>.<verse eid="ROM 3:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 3:25" />Godehe Ene kanolo ninifea dobu amo diba damesisia, Ene Faibe Yesu amo olamesi mebailu. Yesune ibi auba sagalu amohe, idele inolo asigi ule ufulu ili amo Godedai hilise ule melesi seloaba ufulu. Mana amo alefasia, Godehe ninifea Ene E isolu loluba walefe. Saminimo, Godehe idele inolofea esebalo molosia, Ehe idele inolo <char style="w" lemma="Wolu / Wolu mololo">wolu</char> mololumo aso diba ofogosia, elebe inefea obegeba sabe mesiale ligia, aso waagi yasifia alolu. <verse eid="ROM 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 3:26" />E auba yasilabia abia, aga fogo ewe holobagamesi yasisia, Godehe ninifea E isolu koleba loluba waleyo hamefe. Ehe idele inolo Yesufea asigi uleda ufulu ili amo, Ene si saabia isolu melesi moloba ufulu amohe, E isolu labeba walefe.<verse eid="ROM 3:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 3:27" />Aulugulu ninihe, nine meleba aso eneba kaiiba miliyo? Auba koleba male. Mau enene? Ninihe nine kiwi koleba alefasia, mana nafulu mololumo amone maula? Aubale. Asigi ule ufulu amone mau amosu nini kaiiba miliyo. <verse eid="ROM 3:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 3:28" />Nini sulu ewe sefia lolu. Muguli kuliba aafe eno amo alefasia, nini isolu adefeba soluale. Aubale. Asigi ule ofelefe eno amohe, Godehe nini isolu idele inolobamo ami sodo.<verse eid="ROM 3:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 3:29" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3.29 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ROM 10:12">Lom 10.12</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Gode E-mo, <char style="w">Yuda</char> inesu kolebala? E-mo, <char style="w" lemma="Yau idele inolo - Yau mosomu">Yau idele inolone</char> Gode-alela? Aubale. Yuda idele inolone Godeda, aufia yau idele inolone Godeda, E labe. <verse eid="ROM 3:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 3:30" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 6:4">Lo 6.4</ref>; <ref loc="GAL 3:20">Gal 3.20</ref></char></note>Maumo, Gode E-mo ule labe. E alefasia, inolo <char style="w" lemma="Bado amaleba gelelo mana">bado amaleba gelelune</char> asigi ule ufuluda bolo. Aufia, Ehe, inolo <char style="w" lemma="Bado amaleba gelelo mana">bado amaleba gelelualene</char> asigi ule ufulu amoda bolo. Ausi, Ehe ili amo ilifaba ua isolu idele inolo melesi moloba ufiyobafe. <verse eid="ROM 3:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 3:31" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 5:17">Mad 5.17</ref></char></note>Ausiamo, ninihe asigi ule ufulu olaibo kegeleba selesenaga, amo ninihe mugulimo eleda male besabela? Aubale. Nini asigi ule ufulumo alefasia, muguli mana amomo sealeba gaduba selesia, kiwigaaba ofelefe.<verse eid="ROM 3:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="ROM 4" />
  <para style="s">Abalahama e asigi ule ofelesi, Godehe e isolu inoloba ami iminiba ufulu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 4:1" />
    <char style="w">Abalahama</char> e, Yuda nine nauwa. Ninimo, ene ibifea alefasia holobagalu lolu. Abalahamahe asigi ule ufulu mana amone, nini amene baaba golesubi? <verse eid="ROM 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 4:2" />Seale, Abalahama nafulu mana e mololu amofea alefasia, <char style="w" lemma="Godedai isoba melesi moloba ofolo">Godene si saabia isolu</char> alolubiaga, amo alefasia e ene meleba kaiibaiyo. Auluso, auba aulualegulu, e Godene si saabiamo, kaiiba saeyomo lililuale. <verse eid="ROM 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 4:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 15:6">Stt 15.6</ref>; <ref loc="GAL 3:6">Gal 3.6</ref></char></note>Mau amo alefasia, Godene bugohe eweguba selelu dobu. <char style="qt">Abalahama e Godefea <char style="w" lemma="Asigi ule ufulu">asigi ule ofelesi</char>, Godehe e isolu inoloba ami solu.</char><verse eid="ROM 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 4:4" />Helefealufealomo, inolo dabalu molosia, ehe ene elebemo, balu ulu kegele diloguba, dilale. Aubale. Ehe ene elebe amo sabe dilo. <verse eid="ROM 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 4:5" />Auluso, Godefealomo, inolo ulenohe mana nafulu molosia, Godene si saabiamo, aso abobolu koleba besabe. Aulugulu, ehe Godefea, “na mana nafulu mololu amone, elebe sabe memaba” saeyodoluale. Aubale. E-mo, Godefea asigi ule ofelesi, Godehe ene asigi ule ofelefe amone bisigia, inolo amo, ene wolu mololumo bisigiale, efea isolu inoloba selefe. <verse eid="ROM 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 4:6" /><char style="w" lemma="Deibidi">Deibidihe</char> kegele ule hamagane selesia, eweguba selelubiyo. Godehe idele inolo ine mana molofe amo alefasiale, ine asigi ule ufulu amo alefasia, Ehe ili isolu moloba ofelesi, ine henelomo wasigafia alebaibu. <verse eid="ROM 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 4:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.7-8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 32:1-2">Sng 32.1-2</ref></char></note>Deibidihe sulu eweguba selelubiyo.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="ROM 4:7" />
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 4:7">
    <char style="qt">Godehe ulenone heleba daalu amo, <char style="w" lemma="Hamasia heesia galiyo">hamasia heesia galisia</char>, ene <char style="w" lemma="Wolu / Wolu mololo">wolu</char> mololu amo saidafelesi,</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 4:7">
    <char style="qt">inolo amo ene henelomo wasigafia labe.</char><verse eid="ROM 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 4:8" />
    <char style="qt">
      <char style="w" lemma="Saminilo">Saminilohe</char> inolo ulenone wolu moloba yaalumo hiliseba obegebale adesi,</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 4:8">
    <char style="qt">inolo amo ene henelomo wasigafia labe.</char><verse eid="ROM 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 4:9" />Auba aulugulu, henelo wasigafia miliyo amomo, <char style="w" lemma="Bado amaleba gelelo mana">badoda amaleba gelelu</char> inesula? Me <char style="w" lemma="Bado amaleba gelelo mana">badoda amaleba geleluale</char> inedalela? Aa, henelo amo, ineda labe. <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 15:6">Stt 15.6</ref></char></note><char style="qt">Godehe Abalahamane asigi ule ufulu amone asigisia, Ehe e isolu inolo moloba ufulubamo</char>, nahe gilifea selabia mulu. <verse eid="ROM 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 4:10" />Aulugulu, Abalahama e eneba labi, Godehe e isolu inoloba solu? Abalahama e bado amaleba gelefia labi, solula? Me bado amaleba gelebale labi, solubile? Aa, e aso bado amaleba gelebale labi, Godehe efea ga isolu inoloba solu. <verse eid="ROM 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 4:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 17:10-11">Stt 17.10-11</ref></char></note>Dufia, e isolu inolo labeba eloba bamesine iminisia, Godehe Abalahamane bado ami amaleba gelelu. Aulugulu, e aso bado amaleba gelebale ligia, Godefea asigi ule ufulu. Ausi, Godehe e isolu inolo moloba ufulu. Ausiamo, Abalahama e-mo, inolo bado amaleba gelebale asigi ule ufulu amo suniane enao labe. Ili Godefea asigi ule ufulu amo alefasia, Godehe ili amo isolu melesi moloba ofolo. <verse eid="ROM 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 4:12" />Aufia, Abalahama e-mo, inolo bado amaleba geleba yaalu, amodaline enao labe. Na selesumo ewe, ili bado amaleba gelefia ligia, ili ine enao Abalahamane emelalu buu kuliba abia, ilida Godefea asigi ule ofelesenaga, amo Abalahama e ine enao koleba labe. Asigima. Abalahama e aso bado amaleba gelebale ligia, asigi ule auba ufulu.<verse eid="ROM 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Godehe Ene oloba huliale saaba ufulumo asigifia ado</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 4:13" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4.13 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 17:4-6">Stt 17.4-6</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 22:17-18">22.17-18</ref>; <ref loc="GAL 3:29">Gal 3.29</ref></char>
    </note>Gode alefasia, <char style="w" lemma="Abalahama">Abalahamadai</char>, ene enauwadalidai, ilifea oloba huliale sulu saaba ofelesia, helefealu suniamo gineba daalogulu meyoba solu. Auluso, Abalahama e <char style="w">muguli</char> sulu kulisi, oloba huliale sulu ewe efea saaba ufuluale. Aubale. Abalahama e Godefea <char style="w" lemma="Asigi ule ufulu">asigi ule ofelefemo</char> alefasia, Godehe e isolu inolo moloba ofasia, oloba huliale sulu ewe efea saaba ufulu. <verse eid="ROM 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 4:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GAL 3:18">Gal 3.18</ref></char></note>Amo seale, inolohe muguli sulu kuliba aafe amo alefasia, ili daalo kegele ewe sabe disiabiaga, amo asigi ule ufulumone mana eleda male adesia, Godehe oloba huliale sulu saaba ufulu amoda, mololalegulu babaiye. <verse eid="ROM 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 4:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 3:20">Lom 3.20</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 5:13">5.13</ref></char></note>Muguli sulu gelesi, sabe melomo, amo kanolo. Muguli sulu malenaga, inolohe muguli sulu amo gelelale. Auluso, muguli sulu dobimo, inolohe sulu elo ufulu amo gelesi, kanolo efea holobagalo.<verse eid="ROM 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 4:16" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4.16 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GAL 3:7">Gal 3.7</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Auluso, idele inolo ine asigi ule ufulu amo alefasia, oloba huliale sulu saaba ufulumo dilo. Auba oloba huliale sulu saaba ufulumo, moloyobafemo, Godehe ulu kegele meyobafe. Amo saaba ofalu dobu, nini asigibu. Ausi, Abalahamane faibili suniahe, oloba huliale sulu saaba ufulu amo diyobafe. Idele inolo Mosesene sulu muguli bugoda sebumo, ili amonesuale. Aubale. Idele inolo sunia, Abalahama asigi ule ufuluguba, auba ofelefe, amone dobu. Aulugulu, e-mo nini suniane nao labe. <verse eid="ROM 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 4:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 17:5">Stt 17.5</ref></char></note>Amone iminisia, Godene bugo selesia, <char style="qt">“Na alefasia, ga idele inolo mosomu wedinalene enao melesi moloba ufiyobasu”.</char> Abalahama e Gode auba selefe amofea <char style="w" lemma="Asigi ule ufulu">asigi ule ofasia</char>, seale e mosomu wedinalene enao alolubiyo. Gode amo Ehe, danelu dobu ilimo, haiba bebea melesi moloba ofolo. Ehe sulu selesi, kegele sunia samini ufulualemo holobagagaba yaafe. Auba aulo Gode amofea, Abalahama asigi ule ufulu.<verse eid="ROM 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 4:18" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4.18 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 15:5">Stt 15.5</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Abalahama ene e moloyodolualemo, Godehe moloba ufiyobafeba asigisia, <char style="w" lemma="Hame diba ofogosia yasiyo">hame diba ofogofia yasifia</char> alolu. Godehe efea selesia, <char style="qt">“Ge saladegelumo, sigabi alegaeyo babealuguba miliyobafeba”</char> solubiyo. Aulugulu, Abalahama e Godefea asigi ule ofasia, hame auba diba ofogofia daaba alolune, e-mo idele inolo mosomu wedinalene enao alolu. <verse eid="ROM 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 4:19" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 17:17">Stt 17.17</ref></char></note>Abalahama ene hamu daabulubasu daabuluba miliyo hagoale adesi, ene domalamo falasia, olaeyodolugulu alolu. Aufia, e asigisia, ene eamono <char style="w" lemma="Sela">Selamo</char>, ene ela molomo dolobosia, faibe misiyodoluale alolu. Auba asigiba aloluso, ene asigi ule ufulumo kiwigaafia ligia, kiwi saneluale. <verse eid="ROM 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 4:20" />Abalahama e-mo, Godehe oloba huliale sulu efea saaba ufulumo hilisefia, sigiba dubulugulu, asigi ule ufulumo afelesiale, asigi aida ufuluale. Aubale. Ene asigi ule ufulu amohe efea kiwi mesimo, e Godene wi digiba selaba alolu. <verse eid="ROM 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 4:21" />Abalahama e-mo, Godehe oloba huliale sulu saaba ufulumo, seale moloyodolu labe kolebaba hilisefiasu alolu. <verse eid="ROM 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 4:22" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.22-23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 15:6">Stt 15.6</ref></char></note>Aulugulu, Godehe <char style="qt">Abalahamane asigi ule ufulu amone bisigia, Ehe efea isolu inoloba solu.</char> <verse eid="ROM 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 4:23" /><char style="qt">Godehe efea isolu inoloba solu</char>, sulu selelu amo Abalahama efeasu saaba selelu dobuale. <verse eid="ROM 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 4:24" />Aubale. Sulu amo ninifeada selefe. Maumo, nini Godefea asigi ule ofelesi, Ehe ninifeada isolu idele inoloba saeyobafe. Nine Saminilo Yesuda olaiyafia <char style="w" lemma="Haiba degelu - Haiba degeba ifolu">haiba degeba ifolu</char> Gode amo Ehe, auba moloyobafe. <verse eid="ROM 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 4:25" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 53:4-5">Ais 53.4-5</ref></char></note>Godehe inolo ili Yesu waagi dumesi fogo mefia gadefalumo, nine wolu mololumo hamasia heemesifia aulu. Aufia, Godehe E-mo haiba degeba ifolumo, Ehe ninimo isolu melesi moloba ufiyofia aulu.<verse eid="ROM 4:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="ROM 5" />
  <para style="s">Nini Godedai hame diba ofogofia ligia, Edai aeaba misiyobasu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 5:1" />Aulugulu, ninihe Yesufea <char style="w" lemma="Asigi ule ufulu">asigi ule ofelesi</char>, Godehe nini <char style="w" lemma="Godedai isoba melesi moloba ofolo">isolu idele inolo moloba ufulune</char>, ninimo, nine <char style="w">Saminilo</char> Yesu <char style="w" lemma="Keliso">Kelisofea</char> alefasia, Godedai <char style="w" lemma="Aealo - Aeaba Ofolo">aeaba</char> lolu. <verse eid="ROM 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 5:2" />Nini Godefea asigi ule ofelesia, Godene <char style="w">kanululo</char> usu faseba sugamesi, Yesuhe eno sogoba ufulu. Godene kanululo amone saabia, nini aga kiwigaafia yoba lolu. Ausi, nini henefia, Godene <char style="w">elalelu</char> usu ami sugaeyone, <char style="w" lemma="Hame diba ofogosia yasiyo">hame diba ofogofia yasiba</char> lolune, nini koleba kaiisu. <verse eid="ROM 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 5:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5.3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JAS 1:2-3">Yem 1.2-3</ref>; <ref loc="1PE 1:5-7">1Fid 1.5-7</ref></char></note>Amosu nini kaiisuale. Aubale. Higinilu noolo nini labea holobagagafe, amoneda nini kaiisu. Maumo, nini hilisesia, higinilu amohe, nini kiwi sanefia afelesiale, daabasu melesi mololo. <verse eid="ROM 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 5:4" />Aulugulu, kiwi sanefia afelefale mana amohe, nine libo kiwigaafia, hilise ule melesi moloba ofolo. Aufia, hilise ule ado mana amohe, hame diba ofogofia, yasiba melesi mololo. <verse eid="ROM 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 5:5" />Aufia, hame diba ofogofia mololo mana amohe, nini yuamesiale mololo. Maumo, nini hilisesia, Godehe Ene <char style="w" lemma="Asubane Noekene">Asubane Noekenemo</char>, ninifea melumo alefasia, Ene hameselomo, nine libo usu ama sagaba dafogolu dobu.<verse eid="ROM 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 5:6" />Bama. Nini nine meleba sagoba ufiyomo, kiwi male koleba adesi, Godehe fogo iminiba ufulumo adesi ami, Kelisohe idele inolo Godeda faiso mesia waalefe, ili amone sagoba ofelesia olalu. <verse eid="ROM 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 5:7" />Helefealu iwi, inolo no anogo sagoba ufiyone, ene miliyolu weaseyobafemo, inolo uleno labela? Male. Auluso, seale, inolo no anogo e nafulu isolu labenaga, inolo ulenohe, ene libo kolefia, e inolo nafulu amo sagoba ufiyofia, olaeyo hameyobafebile. <verse eid="ROM 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 5:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5.8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 3:16">Yon 3.16</ref>; <ref loc="1JN 4:10">1Yon 4.10</ref></char></note>Auluso, Godehe Ene hameselo ninifea dobuba waleyofiamo, nini aso <char style="w" lemma="Wolu / Wolu mololo">wolusu moloba</char> labi fogomohe, Keliso E-mo, nini sagoba ofelesia olalu.<verse eid="ROM 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 5:9" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5.9 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ROM 1:18">Lom 1.18</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 2:5">2.5</ref>; <ref loc="EPH 2:3-5">Efe 2.3-5</ref></char>
    </note>Nini asigisia, Godehe Yesune ibifea alefasia, nini isolu idele inolo moloba ufuluba asigibu. Aulune, eweda nini asigiyo dobu. Godehe Yesufea alefasia, nini kanolofealo alebaibia amifia, gasifia siba dafelagoyobafe.<verse eid="ROM 5:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 5:10" />Nini aso Godedai gisa alebaibimo, Ene Faibe olalumo alefasia, nini seloaba ofelesia, Edai hilise ule melesi gadefalu. Auba aulugulu, aga nini Godedai hilise ule adesia, Ene Faibene miliyolu amo alefasia, nini seale koleba <char style="w" lemma="Gasiba dafelagoba dilo">gasiba dafelagoba diyobafe</char>. <verse eid="ROM 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 5:11" />Aufia, amo hamagale. Nine Saminilo Yesu Kelisohe, ninimo Edai hilise ule melesi moloba ufuluba hilisesia, nini Godefea kaiiba selaba lolu.<verse eid="ROM 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Adama alefasiamo, olalo holobagaluso, nolobalomo, Yesu E alefasiamo, miliyolu holobagalu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 5:12" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5.12 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 3:6">Stt 3.6</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 6:23">Lom 6.23</ref></char>
    </note>Inolo ule mololumo alefasia, wolu helefealu iwi faseba suga mulu. Wolu amohe, olalo lubia faseba mulu. Eno amohe olalomo, idele inolo sunia alebaibia goabu. Maumo, idele inolo sunia wolu moloba yaalo. <verse eid="ROM 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 5:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5.13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 4:15">Lom 4.15</ref></char></note>Mosesene <char style="w">muguli</char> aso holobagabale labimo, wolumo helefealu iwi ama ufia alolu. Muguli malene, wolu mololomo alegalale. <verse eid="ROM 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 5:14" />Auluso, sulu muguli aso maleiya fogo amida, wolu molofe ili amo wolune elebe diaba yaalu. Enebamo, <char style="w" lemma="Adama">Adamane</char> hiliafia maugafia abia, <char style="w">Mosese</char> muguli meiya hiliamo, olalohe, idele inolo sunia fogo amida, yasifia uluba alolu. Adamahe Godene sulu kuliba abiale, wolu mololu. Idele inolo e faisa mulumo, wolu molosiamo, ilihe Adama mololuguba aubasu mololuale. Auluso, olalohe ili amo suniada aso sesaiba samodofia alolubiyo.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ROM 5:14">Adama e-mo, inolo dufia miyobafe amone mimisililu alolu. <verse eid="ROM 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 5:15" />Auluso, Godehe ulu kegele melu amomo, Adama heleba daalu amoguluale. Maumo, inolo ulehe heleba daalu amofea alefasia, idele inolo wedinale daneba yaalu. Auluso, Godene <char style="w">kanululo</char> amohe, Adamane heleba daalu amo sunialu. Godehe inolo ule Yesu Kelisofea alefasia, idele inolo wedinalefea, ulu kegele melu. Amomo, ili wedinalefea wasigafia, hano galebaisaloguba, galebaisafe.<verse eid="ROM 5:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 5:16" />Aufia, Godene ulu kegele mesia, moloba dafelagolu amohe, inolo ulene wolu molosia, moloba dafelagolumo sunialu. Enebamo, wolu uledale milifasia labi, osolaeyomo amone faisa holobagasia, amohe mololusia sesia, osolaba dafiyomo lubia mulu. Auluso, Godene kanululo amo, mana amone nolobalo eweguba labe. Heleba dedalelo wedinale amodale milifasia labi, Gode Ene ulu kegele amone faisa holobagasia, amohe, idele inolo isolu melesi moloba ufiyone lubia mulu.<verse eid="ROM 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 5:17" />Inolo ule heleba daalu amo alefasia, olalohe, idele inolo sunia sesaiba yaafia, yasilo alolubiyo. Auluso, agamo, inolo ule Yesu Keliso alefasia, idele inolo ili Gode Ene kanululo wasigalumo difasia, ili bebea sigia, yasilo ine alebaiyobafe. Godehe idele inolo ili amofea ulu kegele mesia, ili isolu melesi moloba ufulu.<verse eid="ROM 5:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 5:18" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5.18 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1CO 15:22">1Kld 15.22</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Aulugulu, inolo ule heleba daalu amo alefasia, idele inolo sunia mololusia osolaba dafalilu alebaibu. Auluso, inolo ule isolu mololu amo alefasia, idele inolo sunia Godedai isolu molofia gadefaeyosia, moloba dafelagolu. Amo alefasia, miliyolu sealemo, ilifea dia mulu. <verse eid="ROM 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 5:19" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5.19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 53:11">Ais 53.11</ref></char></note>Inolo ulehe Godene sulu dofasia, kuliba daaluale amo alefasia, idele inolo wedinalemo, <char style="w" lemma="Wolu / Wolu mololo">wolu mololo</char> melesi moloba ufulu. Amogubasu, nolobalomo, inolo ulehe, Godene sulu dofasia, kuliba daalu amo alefasia, idele inolo wedinalemo isolu melesi moloba ufiyobafe.<verse eid="ROM 5:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 5:20" />Idele inolo ili heleba daaluba hilisemesine, Godehe muguli sulu saaba ufulu. Auluso, wolu bulesimo, Godene kanululoda bulesia, amo sunialu. <verse eid="ROM 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 5:21" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5.21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 6:23">Lom 6.23</ref></char></note>Aulugulu, woluhe idele inolo olalofealo lubia abia, ine yasilo labi, nolobalomo, Godene kanululohe idele inolo <char style="w" lemma="Miliyolu miliyo">miliyolu miliyofealo</char> lubia abia, aubasu yasilo labe. Ehe nine Saminilo Yesu Kelisofea alefasia, idele inolo isolu moloba ofelesia aufe.<verse eid="ROM 5:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="ROM 6" />
  <para style="s">Ninimo wolufealo olafia alebaibu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 6:1" />Aulugulu, nini amone eneba saeyobi? Godehe nini <char style="w" lemma="Kanululo">kanululomo</char> bule wasigamesi, nini <char style="w" lemma="Wolu / Wolu mololo">wolu</char> mololabia daabasu miliyobile? <verse eid="ROM 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 6:2" />Auba auyobafale! Ninimo wolufealo olafia alebaibugulu, ninihe wolu mololabia abia, saabia no aselabia maiyale. <verse eid="ROM 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 6:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6.3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GAL 3:27">Gal 3.27</ref></char></note>Ninimo <char style="w">Keliso</char> Yesudai kulisia, <char style="w" lemma="Hano gelo">hano gelu</char>. Auba mololu amohe, nini Edai kulisia, olaluba walelu. Gili auba asigifia ligia, galilosi. <verse eid="ROM 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 6:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6.4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 2:12">Kol 2.12</ref></char></note>Nini <char style="w" lemma="Hano gelo">hano gesia</char>, Yesudai olasi, baliba ufulu. Ami ligiamo, Naone <char style="w">elalelu</char> kiwigagaluda amofea alefasia, Keliso E daneba yaaiyafia, degeba ifolu amoguba, ninida aubasu miliyolu hili amo aselabia, dedalebasu melesi gadefalu. <figure style="fig" alt="People being baptized" file="44_Ac_02_11_RG.jpg" size="col" copy="Sweet Publishing" ref="6.3-9">Idele inolo hano gefe.</figure><verse eid="ROM 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ninimo Kelisodai bebea alebaibu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 6:5" />Nini Kelisodai kulisia olalunaga, E degelugulu, ninida Efea kulifia alebaibune, degeyobafe. <verse eid="ROM 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 6:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6.6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GAL 5:24">Gal 5.24</ref></char></note>Nini asigibu, nine libo amakelelumo Kelisodai imolane uluba ofelesia, olalu dobu. Amohe, nine domalane <char style="w" lemma="Wolu / Wolu mololo">wolu</char> mololo amone kiwi olaboba dafogolu. Ausi, woluhe, ninifea ene dibolo inologulu balu dabalu molomaba saabia no saeyodoluale. <verse eid="ROM 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 6:7" />Mau enebamo, olalu inolomo, molomaba selefemo dobolale ligia, sulu amo kuliba maiyodoluale. Aubale. E beega labe. Aulune, woluhe efea saabia no molomasia yasiyobafale.<verse eid="ROM 6:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 6:8" />Nini Kelisodai olalugulu, nini Edai bebea misiyoba hilisesia, amone <char style="w">asigi ule ufulu</char>. <verse eid="ROM 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 6:9" />Maumo, ninihe eweguba asigibu, Kelisomo olafasia, daneba yaaiya amifia <char style="w" lemma="Haiba degelu - Haiba degeba ifolu">haiba degelugulu</char>, E haiba saabia no olaeyobafale. Aubale. Olalone kiwigagaluhe, E haiba saabia no yasisia, E dufa dafogoyobafale. <verse eid="ROM 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 6:10" />Yesu olalumo, E fogo uluse olasia, wolune kiwigagalumo sunia bidifia, saidafulu. Aufia, E bebea labemo, E aga Godedai bebea saabe.<verse eid="ROM 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 6:11" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6.11 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2CO 5:15">2Kld 5.15</ref>; <ref loc="GAL 2:19">Gal 2.19</ref></char>
    </note>Eno amogubasu, gilida gine miliyolumo eweguba bamale. Wolufealomo, gili olalu dobu. Auluso, gili Keliso Yesudai kulifia alebaisia, Godedai bebea alebaibu. <verse eid="ROM 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 6:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6.12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 4:7">Stt 4.7</ref></char></note>Aulugulu gili, domalane wolu molobaiyesia, mesegelo amone kuliba anosi, woluhe gine olalone domala ogo aso molomasia yasifia melesi fogo memabiyo. <verse eid="ROM 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 6:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6.13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 12:1">Lom 12.1</ref></char></note>Gili olalu degeba ifofia, bebea alebaibugulu, gine meleba Godefea mefia melale. Gine domala haisi ulenomo, isoluale manane dabalu moloyone wolufea memabiyo. Aubale. Gine domala haisi haisiba sunia, isolu manane dabalu moloyone Godefea memale.<verse eid="ROM 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 6:14" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6.14 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1JN 3:6">1Yon 3.6</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Enebamo, woluhe gili saabia no yasiyobafale. Maumo, gili <char style="w">muguli</char> sisa alebaibuale. Aubale. Gilimo Godene <char style="w">kanululo</char> sisa labe.<verse eid="ROM 6:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Aga isolu mana nine biso labi, nini amone balu dabalu moloyo alebailu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 6:15" />Aulugulu, nini amone eneba moloyobi? Nini aga <char style="w">muguli</char> sisa ami saabia no alebaisiale, Godene <char style="w">kanululo</char> sisa alebaibugulu, ninihe mana wolu waagi moloyobile? Auba moloyo hilisemabiyo! <verse eid="ROM 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 6:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6.16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 8:34">Yon 8.34</ref>; <ref loc="2PE 2:19">2Fid 2.19</ref></char></note>Gili <char style="w" lemma="Balu dabalu moloba ofolo faibe">balu dabalu mololo</char> amone mana asigima. Gilihe gine meleba, inolo ulenofea ene balu dabalu moloyone mefia elenaga, amo e gafea molomasi, gili ene sulu kuliba maiyo dobu. Inolo abehe molomaba solu suluda gili kuliba aafe amo, e gine yasilo labe. Aubasu, <char style="w" lemma="Wolu / Wolu mololo">woluhe</char> molomasi, gili amone balu dabalu moloba alebaisenaga, amohe gili olalofealo ami ulubia maiyobafe. Auluso, gilihe Godene balu dabalu mololo ligia, Ene sulu dofasia kuliba aasenaga, amohe, gili isolu moloba ufuluiya ami ulubia maiyobafe. <verse eid="ROM 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 6:17" />Saminimo, gili wolune balu dabalu mololo adesi, wolumo gine yasilo alolu. Auluso, aga Godefea wisoba henema. Enebamo, aga gili gine libo suniahe, Godene sulu mana gilifea walelumo, sigiba dobelesia, sulu amo kuliba dedaleba labe. <verse eid="ROM 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 6:18" />Godehe gili wolu dabalu mololofealofia sububa dafelagofia, aga gilimo isolu mana amone balu dabalu mololo melesi moloba ufulu.<verse eid="ROM 6:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 6:19" />Gine asigi abobofe amone bisigia, na sulu solu ewe helefealufea balu dabalu mololo mana amone dedeba selesu. Gili maa asigilosi. Saminimo, gili wolu nugumaluda, wolune wolu bule kolebada, amone balu dabalu moloyofia, gine domala haisi noolomo mana amofea melabiasu daaba alolu. Auluso, agamo amogubasu, isolu manane balu dabalu moloyofia, gine domala haisi haisiba ogo, isolu mana amofea melabiasu daaba melale. Ausia, gilimo Gode Ene idele inolo adesia, gili Edai <char style="w">muuba kalilu</char> ligia, noekene miliyobafe.<verse eid="ROM 6:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 6:20" />Gili aso wolune balu dabalu mololo alebaibimo, isolu manahe gili yasifia aloluale. <verse eid="ROM 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 6:21" />Gili auba moloba labi, mana aga gili yuafe ogofeafia sebe halagulu suba yaalu? Olaeyone sebe amosu suba yaalu. <verse eid="ROM 6:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 6:22" />Auluso, agamo, gili Godene balu dabalu moloba ofolo faibe holobagafia labimo, wolu manahe, gili saabia no yasifia uluba labale. Aulugulu, gili aga sebe susiamo, Godedai muuba kalilu koleba ligia, <char style="w" lemma="Miliyolu miliyo">miliyolu miliyone</char> sebe suba yaafe. <verse eid="ROM 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 6:23" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6.23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 5:12">Lom 5.12</ref>, <ref loc="ROM 5:15">15</ref></char></note>Elebe, woluhe mefe amo, olaeyo. Ulu kegele Godehe mefe amo, miliyolu miliyo. Ausi, nini nine <char style="w">Saminilo</char> Yesu Kelisofea kulifia ligia, miliyolu alefalu miliyobasu.<verse eid="ROM 6:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="ROM 7" />
  <para style="s">Mugulifealomo amifia sububa dafelagosia, Kelisodai kulifia ligia, nini beega lolu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 7:1" />Ne damenedali, <char style="w">muguli</char> mana amoda nafuluba hilisebu gilifea selesu. Gili hilisebu, inolo aso bebea aselabia aasimo, muguli suluhe e sefia uluba adabiasu abia, e olasi elolo. <verse eid="ROM 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 7:2" />Nahe sulu ewe dedeba saeyobasu. Ido aino aso bebea saabimo, e muguli suluhe ainodai godaiba ufia labe. Auluso, aino olasenaga, e ainodai godaiba ufulu muguli amohe, e saabia no sebualegulu, e beega labe. <verse eid="ROM 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 7:3" />Auluso, idomo aino aso bebea saabi, ehe inolo nodai adesenaga, amo ilihe ido amomo susugu idoba saeyobafe. Auluso, ene aino amo olasenaga, muguli amohe e saabia no sebualene, e beega labe. Aulugulu, aino olafia labi, e inolo nofea aasenaga, amo e susugu molofale.<verse eid="ROM 7:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 7:4" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7.4 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ROM 6:2">Lom 6.2</ref>, <ref loc="ROM 6:11">11</ref></char>
    </note>Aulugulu, ne damenedali, ido ainoda amone sadalu amohe gilifea iminiba selefe. <char style="w">Keliso</char> olalu amo alefasia, mugulifealomo gili olalu dobu. Aulugulu, gilimo inolo nofea maiyone, aga beega alebaibu. Inolo No amomo, olaiyafia <char style="w" lemma="Haiba degelu - Haiba degeba ifolu">haiba degelu</char> amo, E labe. Efea daafia ligia, gilihe Godefea meyone sebe nafulu heleyo dobu.<verse eid="ROM 7:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 7:5" />Samini, ninihe <char style="w" lemma="Helefealune huu">helefealune huune</char> hame sisa aso kuliba daaba alebaibimo, mugulihe nine domalafea mana <char style="w" lemma="Wolu / Wolu mololo">wolu</char> molobaiyeba mesegelo amo degeba ifosi, nini molofe amone sebe helesiamo, olalone sebe amosu helelo. <verse eid="ROM 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 7:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7.6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 8:2">Lom 8.2</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 6:4">6.4</ref></char></note>Auluso, samini ninimo mugulidai godaifia ufulu aloluso, agamo nini olalugulu, mugulifealomo, nini beega alebaibu. Aulugulu, agamo, nini muguline dabalu saabia no molobale ligia, aga ninimo, Asubanene eno hili amone kuliba abia, Ene dabalu molosu.<verse eid="ROM 7:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Muguli sulu saaba ufulu amo, kegele wolula?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 7:7" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7.7 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 20:17">Kis 20.17</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:21">Lo 5.21</ref></char>
    </note>Auba aulugulu, ninihe eneba saeyobi? Mosesene <char style="w">muguli</char> sulu amo, kegele <char style="w" lemma="Wolu / Wolu mololo">wolubile</char>? Seale aubale koleba. Muguli ufulualebiaga, wolu mana amogulu dobubamo, na eloba babaiyale. Muguli amo selesia, <char style="qt">“Mesegemabiyoba”</char> saaba ufulualebiaga, mesegelo mana amo amogulububa, nini asigibaiyale. <verse eid="ROM 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 7:8" />Auluso, woluhe mugulifea alefasia, eno isafia, ne asigine libo usu iwimo, mesegelo mana nokene nokeneba molomesi degeba ifolu. Auluso, mugulida malebiaga, wolu amo kiwida male adesia, olalugulu alebaiye. <verse eid="ROM 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 7:9" />Samini, na aso muguli manada asigibale asulu. Auluso, muguline molomalelu sulu na labea holobagasi, wolumo nafea bebea aselesia degeba ofelesi, na olaeyofealo daaba alolu. <verse eid="ROM 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 7:10" />Molomalelu sulu amohe nafeamo miliyolu meyobafeba hiliseluso, olalo amone mefe. <verse eid="ROM 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 7:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7.11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 3:13">Stt 3.13</ref></char></note>Mau enebamo, woluhe molomalelu sulu saaba ufulu amo difasia, na wolu molomesi gegelu. Mana amo alefasia, woluhe na dufa olalu.<verse eid="ROM 7:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 7:12" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7.12 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1TI 1:8">1Dim 1.8</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Auluso, muguli sulu amo ene-mo, <char style="w" lemma="Muuba kalilu">muuba kalilu noekene</char> koleba dobu. Aufia, molomalelu sulu saaba ufulu amoda, muuba kalilu noekene, isolu seale nafulu dobu. <verse eid="ROM 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 7:13" />Ausenaga, eneba labe? Kegele nafulu amohe, aga nada dufa olaeyone kegele holobagalu dobula? Aubale koleba. Nada dufa olaeyone kegele amo kolebamo, wolu mana. Wolu manahe, kegele nafulu amo difasia, na dufa olamesi mololu. Auba mololumo alefasia, muguline molomalelu sulu saaba ufulu amo ulufa ofelesia, Godehe wolumo sesenelu kolebaba eloba bamesi ulufaba ufulu.<verse eid="ROM 7:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wolu manahe keliso idele inolone libo usu belaguba labe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 7:14" />Nini hilisesiamo, <char style="w">muguli</char> sulumo, Godene Asubanefea alefasia mulu. Auluso, nene na-mo, <char style="w">helefealune huu</char> lolu. Auba kiwidale ligiamo, na <char style="w" lemma="Wolu / Wolu mololo">wolu</char> mana amone balu dabalu molomesi gadefasi, lolubu. <verse eid="ROM 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 7:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7.15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GAL 5:17">Gal 5.17</ref></char></note>Na nene molosumo, amo molosuba nafuluba fadaba asigibale ligia, molosu. Mana na molobaiyeba asigilu amo, na mololale. Aubale. Mana na haboba bolomo, na mololo. <verse eid="ROM 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 7:16" />Aulugulu, nahe mana na moloyo hameluale amone moloba ligia, na mana amo nafulualebuba hilisesenaga, amohe walesia, na Godedai eesia, Ene muguli sulu amo nafulu dobuba hilisesububa walefe. <verse eid="ROM 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 7:17" />Aulugulu, na auba auyaleba eefia, mana na hamelualemo aso moloba elenaga, amo, auba molofe amo, nene naalebu. Aubale. Wolu nafea usu iwi yoba saabe ewe, e molofe.<verse eid="ROM 7:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 7:18" />Ausi, na eloba bisigiamo, kegele nafulu uleno ne libo usu iwi male koleba. Na auba selesumo, ne helefealune huu amone iminiba selesu. Maumo, na mana nafulu molobaiyeba hamelo. Auluso, mana nafulu moloba yaeyomo, na moloyodoluale ado. <verse eid="ROM 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 7:19" />Maumo, mana nafulu na molobaiyeba hamelomo, na mololale. Aubale. Mana wolu na moloyo hameluale ewemo, na molobasu ado. <verse eid="ROM 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 7:20" />Nahe mana na moloyo hameluale amo molosenaga, amo nene na molosuale. Aubale. Wolu nafea usu iwi yoba saabe amo, e mololo.<verse eid="ROM 7:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 7:21" />Aulugulu, moloba holobagaba ado mana ewehe sigiba molosi, na amo eloba bosolu. Moloba holobagaba ado mana ewe. Nahe nafulu molobaiyeba hilisesimo, wolu na galiba labe ewe moloba dafelagolo. <verse eid="ROM 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 7:22" />Seale, ne asigine libo usumo, Godene sulu muguli amo na hamesia, heafuba molobaiyeba ado. <verse eid="ROM 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 7:23" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7.23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GAL 5:17">Gal 5.17</ref>; <ref loc="1PE 2:11">1Fid 2.11</ref></char></note>Auluso, moloba holobagaba ado mana ewehe sigiba molosi, na eloba bosolu. Mana amohe, Godene sulu muguli ne asigine libo usu dobu ewedai belagusia, sigi sigisia diba bobolefe. Ausi, wolu na domalafea labe amohe na dofaba ofelesi, na amone dibolo lolu. <verse eid="ROM 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 7:24" />Yeele, na woba dafulu inolo! Abehe na olalone domala ewefeafia sububa dafelagoyobafebi? <verse eid="ROM 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 7:25" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7.25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 15:57">1Kld 15.57</ref></char></note>Nine <char style="w">Saminilo</char> Yesu Keliso Ehe, na sububa dafelagoyobafe koleba! Aulugulu, Godefea na wisoba selesu!</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ROM 7:25">Auba sulu saaba samodosiamo, na eweguba selesu. Ne asigine libofealomo, nene na Godene sulu muguli sisa ligia, amo kuliba daaba ado. Auluso, ne helefealune huufealomo, na wolune molomalelu sulu sisa ligia, amo kuliba daaba moloba ado.<verse eid="ROM 7:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="ROM 8" />
  <para style="s">Kelisohe wolu dibia saidafasia, Asubane Noekenemo ninifea melu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 8:1" />Idele inolo Yesu Kelisodai kulifia alebaibu ili amo, ulenohe ili fadaasia, mololusia sesia, osolaba dafiyobafale. <verse eid="ROM 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 8:2" />Maumo, nini <char style="w" lemma="Wolu / Wolu mololo">woludai</char>, olalodai, amone kiwi sisa alebaibi, Keliso Yesufea alefasia, Asubanene mana amohe, ninifea miliyolu mesia, ninimo wolune mana amofeafia sububa dafelagolubu. <verse eid="ROM 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 8:3" />Mosesene <char style="w">muguli</char> sulu amohe, nini sububa dafelagoyodoluale alolu. Maumo, nine <char style="w">helefealune huu</char> amofea alefasia, muguli sulu kuliba maiyone mana amo kiwida male alolu. Auluso, muguli alefasia moloyodolualemo, Godehe mololu. Gode alefasia, Ene Faibe mebailumo, E inolo adesia, E-mo ninigulu wolu moloyodolune huuda alolu. E-mo nine wolu mololo amone isoyone mulu. Godehe Yesune huufea alefasia, wolumo fadaafia, mololusia, sefia osolaba dafelesia, amone kiwimo olaboba dafogolu. <verse eid="ROM 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 8:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8.4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GAL 5:16">Gal 5.16</ref>, <ref loc="GAL 5:25">25</ref></char></note>Gode auba mololu amo, muguli sulu amone isolu manamo nine miliyolufea ililiba moloba holobagamesifia mololu. Ausi, aga ninimo, helefealune huu amone mana saabia no mololabia daaba loluale. Aubale. Ninimo <char style="w">Asubane Noekene</char> amone mana mololabia daaba lolu.<verse eid="ROM 8:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 8:5" />Idele inolo helefealune huune manada kuliba aafe ilimo, ine libone asigimo, helefealune huu amone hame amosu migagaba kuliba ano. Auluso, idele inolo Asubane Noekenene manada kuliba daaba labe ilimo, ine asigimo, Asubane Noekene amone hame migagaba kuliba ano. <verse eid="ROM 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 8:6" />Helefealune huu amohe, idele inolomo olalofealo lubia ano. Auluso, Asubane Noekenehe, idele inolo miliyolufealomo lubia aasi, ili amo miliyolu difasia, <char style="w" lemma="Aealo - Aeaba Ofolo">aeaba</char> miliyobafe. <verse eid="ROM 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 8:7" />Idele inolo abehe, ine asigimo helefealune huu uluba labi adefemo, asigi amogulumo Godedai gisa adefe. Asigi amogulumo Godene sulu muguli sisa labalene, amohe Godene muguli sulu kuliba daaba moloyodoluale koleba ado. <verse eid="ROM 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 8:8" />Helefealune huu amohe yasifia uluba labe amo ili amohe, Gode henemesi moloyodoluale koleba.<verse eid="ROM 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 8:9" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">8.9 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1CO 3:16">1Kld 3.16</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 12:3">12.3</ref></char>
    </note>Auluso gilimo, helefealune huu amohe, gili haiba saabia no yasifia uluba labale. Aubale. Godene Asubane gilifea seale elenaga, amo agamo, Asubane Noekenehe gili yasifia uluba labe. Aufia, idele inolo <char style="w" lemma="Keliso">Kelisone</char> Asubane malenaga, ili amo Keliso Eneale koleba labe. <verse eid="ROM 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 8:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8.10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GAL 2:20">Gal 2.20</ref></char></note>Wolu aso helefealu iwi dobune, gine domalamo aso olalo domala labe. Amo seale. Auluso, Keliso gilifea saabenaga, gili Godedai isolu molofia gadefalu amo alefasia, gine asubane bebea labe. <verse eid="ROM 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 8:11" />Keliso Yesuda olaiyafia degeba ifolu amone Asubanemo, gilifea yoba saabenaga, Gode amo ule hamaga, Ehe gine olalo domala ogofea miliyolu meyobafe. Ene Asubane gilidai saabe ogofea alefasia, Ehe auba moloyobafe.<verse eid="ROM 8:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Asubane Noekenehe nini Godene faibe alebaimesi moloba ufulu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 8:12" />Aulugulu, ne damenedali, ninifea melumo dobu. Auluso, heleba nofea sabe obegeba melosi, ninihe <char style="w" lemma="Helefealune huu">helefealune huune</char> hame kuliba dedalesiamo, amofea sabe obegeba memabiyo. <verse eid="ROM 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 8:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8.13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GAL 6:8">Gal 6.8</ref>; <ref loc="COL 3:5">Kol 3.5</ref></char></note>Enebamo, gili helefealune huune mana kuliba dedaleba elenaga, amo gili olamesine gadefafia alebaibu. Auluso, <char style="w" lemma="Asubane Noekene">Asubane Noekenene</char> kiwi amofea alefasia, gilihe gine domalane mana wolu amo dufa olasenaga, amo gili bebea kakainaeyobafe.<verse eid="ROM 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 8:14" />Idele inolo Godene Asubanehe uluba dia dedaleba labe ili amo sunia, Godene faibili koleba alebaibu. <verse eid="ROM 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 8:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8.15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 14:36">Mag 14.36</ref>; <ref loc="GAL 4:5-7">Gal 4.5-7</ref>; <ref loc="2TI 1:7">2Dim 1.7</ref>; <ref loc="REV 21:7">MUU 21.7</ref></char></note>Godene Asubane ninifea melu amohe, gili haiba sagiliba mesesialefia, haiba saabia no dibolo dabalu moloba melesi gadefalale. Aubale. Godene Asubane gili dulu amo alefasia, Godehe gili fofoba disia, Ene faibili koleba adaaba yaamesi gadefalo. Ausimo, Asubanene kiwi amo alefasia, nini Godefea wuaaba selesiamo, nini “<char style="sls">Aba</char><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8.15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Alamo sulu amo Yesune sulu. Ilihe Naoba selesiamo, </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Aba</char><char style="ft" closed="false">ba sodo. Aufia, Yesuhe Godedai sulu selesiamo, amo Ene Enaogulu, Ehe Godefeamo “</char><char style="fq" closed="false">Aba</char><char style="ft" closed="false">, Nao-oooba” sodo. (Maga 14.36 ami bamale.)</char></note>, Nao-oooba” sodo. <verse eid="ROM 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 8:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8.16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CO 1:22">2Kld 1.22</ref></char></note>Godene Asubane Enemo, nine asubanedai adesia, ninimo Godene faibili seale koleba alebaibubamo, ulufaba dafa selaba labe. <verse eid="ROM 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 8:17" />Aulugulu, aga nini Godene faibili adaaba yaabu. Aulune, agamo, daalo diyo amoneda, nini alebaibu. Godene daalo diyo ligia, nini Yesu Kelisodai ua daalo diyone alebaibu. Daalo diyone kegele, nini Edai osolaba diyomo, ewe. Ninida Yesu naga dulu auba diabia dedaleba elenaga, amo E elalelu koleba kalugaasimo, ninida Ene elalelu kiwida amone osolaba diaba yaeyobasu.<verse eid="ROM 8:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Dufia nini elalelu kiwida diaba yaeyobasu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 8:18" />Na eloba bisigia, higinilu nini aga diaba yaasu amodai iminisiamo, <char style="w">elalelu</char> kiwida ninifea ulufaba waleyobafe amohe, higinilu amo bule suniafia, wasolu kolebabuba bosolu. <verse eid="ROM 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 8:19" />Kegele sunia Gode moloba yaalu ewemo, kegele ewe holobagamesifia, yasifia alebaibu. Godene faibili ili amobuba ulufaba waleba yaamesifia, ili amo babaiyeba koleba yasifia sidafia alebaibu. <verse eid="ROM 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 8:20" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8.20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 3:17-19">Stt 3.17-19</ref></char></note>Wolumo helefealu iwi faseba saabimo, kegele sunia Gode mololu dobu ewemo, woba dafalilu. Ausia, kegele sunia olalone kiwi sisa ofelesia, eleda male koleba adabia, dedalemesi gadefafia alolu. Amomo, ine hamefea alefasia, auba holobagaluale. Aubale. Godene hame alefasia, kegele sunia auba moloba ufia gadefalu.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8.20 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Adamadai Ibadai Godene sulu saidafelesi, wolu helefealu iwi faseba mulu. Aufia, kegele Gode mololumo, wolu amohe sunia medeba samodolu. Aulune, wolu waagi alefalu adosifia, Godehe kegele sunia olalone kiwi sisa melesi gadefalu. </char></note> Helefealu kegele auba gadefalu dobimo, Godehe ili haiba nafuluba momolobaiyeba <char style="w" lemma="Hame diba ofogosia yasiyo">hame diba ofogofia yasife</char>. <verse eid="ROM 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 8:21" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8.21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 11:6-9">Ais 11.6-9</ref></char></note>Enebamo, Godehe helefealu kegele sunia ewe, aga olasia seseneyomo dofafia, diba dobia amifia, sububa dafaliba lagoyobafe. Fogo amimo, Godehe kegele E mololumo sunia auba uluba dibia saabi, helefealu kegele suniada, Godene faibe suniada, ili ua, Ene elalelu kiwida usu amimo, beega ligia, nafulu kakainaeyobafe.<verse eid="ROM 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 8:22" />Nini asigifemo, idelehe faibe hasesia naga dilo amoguba, helefealu kegele sunia amoda auba naga sogoolabiasu inigia, aga iwida goafe. <verse eid="ROM 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 8:23" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8.23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CO 5:2-4">2Kld 5.2-4</ref></char></note>Helefealu kegele amosuale, ninida nine libo usu iwi naga sogooba lolu. Ninihe Asubanemo, <char style="w" lemma="Sebe olaibo">sebe olaibogulu</char><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8.23 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Isolaele ilihe ine geiya </char><char style="fq" closed="false">sebe olaibo </char><char style="ft" closed="false">maugaba susiamo, amo Godefeadale ulu melo. Auba mololomo, Godehe ili uluba aloluba wisoba henesia melo. (Kisim Bek 23.19 ami bamale.) </char></note> dulu. Aulugulu, sebe nooloda aso helelemesi nini yasifia alebaibu. Nini Godene faibe loluba ulufaba walemesi, ninihe amo babaiyeba koleba, yasifia sidafia alebaibu. Aufia, Godehe nine domala olalofealo dobia amifia, obegeba dimesifia yasisia, nini naga sogoosia alebaibu. <verse eid="ROM 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 8:24" />Godehe nini <char style="w" lemma="Gasiba dafelagoba dilo">gasiba dafelagoba dulune</char>, Godehe auba molomesifia, nini <char style="w" lemma="Hame diba ofogosia yasiyo">hame diba ofogofia yasiba</char> alebaibu. Ninihe kegele diyone hame diba ofogofia yasisuba selesenaga, amo aso dulualeba selefe. Enebamo, inolohe kegele dulunaga, kegele amo diyoba hame diba ofogofia, haiba saabia no yasilale. <verse eid="ROM 8:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 8:25" />Aubale. Kegele nini aso dulualemo, Godehe ninifea memesiba hame diba ofogofia ligiamo, nini kiwi sanefia afelesiale, amo babaiyeba koleba yasifia sidafia alebaibu.<verse eid="ROM 8:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 8:26" />Ninimo kiwi sanelu bisigiamo, Asubanehe nini sagoba ofa, Godedai sulu saaba ofolo. Ninimo Godedai sulu eneba saeyobiba babeaba adesimo, Asubane nini aniba inigia, Ehe ninifea sagoba ufiyo ano. E auba sagoba ofelesiamo, Ehe Godefea moloba waleba ligia, Godedai, ninidai, olea ado. E auba olea ligia, moloba waleyone sulu saeyo abobosi, Eda naga sogooba ado. <verse eid="ROM 8:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 8:27" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8.27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 139:1">Sng 139.1</ref></char></note>Ausi, Godehe idele inolone libo usu dobuda fadaba bolo amo Ehe, Asubanene asigi hilisebu amoda asigibu. Maumo, Asubanehe Godene idele inolo sagoba ofelesia, olea ligia, Ehe Godene hame kuliba ano.<verse eid="ROM 8:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 8:28" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">8.28 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EPH 1:11">Efe 1.11</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Nini ewe asigibu. Efeada hameselu ili amofea, Godehe nafulusu moloyo hamefe. Auyosia, ilifea amene kegele helefealu iwi holobagafe sunia, amo waagi ua gegoaba ofasia, kegele amohe ili sagoba ufiyone dabalu molomesi gadefalo. Idele inolo Godehe Ene melesi daiyafia welu alebaibu, ili amofea Ehe auba mololo. <verse eid="ROM 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 8:29" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8.29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 1:18">Kol 1.18</ref>; <ref loc="HEB 1:6">Hib 1.6</ref></char></note>Godehe helefealu aso molobale ligiamo, Ehe ili amo asigilu. Aufia, Ehe ili amo iminisia, Ene Faibe Yesu waagulu seale mimisililu holobagamesi moloba ufulu. Amogubamo, Godehe Yesu Ene elewodali, enanodali, wedinale amone olaibo melesifia aulu. <verse eid="ROM 8:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 8:30" />Idele inolo Godehe samini waagi iminilu ili amo, Ehe ili iminilu amosuale. Aubale. Ehe ili iminifasia, welu. Welu amosuale. Aubale. Ehe ili wefasia, <char style="w" lemma="Godedai isoba melesi moloba ofolo">Edai isolu melesi moloba ufulu</char>. Aufia, isolu melesi moloba ufulu amosuale. Aubale. Ehe ili isolu melesi moloba ofasia, ili amoda Ene elalelu kiwida usu melesi gadefalu.<verse eid="ROM 8:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Godene hameselomo kaeyonemo, kegele ulenoda male koleba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 8:31" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">8.31 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 118:6">Sng 118.6</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Godehe auba koleba kegele nafulu mololugulu, nini amone eneba gegoaba saeyobi? Gode E ninidai labimo, uleno ninidai gisa adesia, kaamo miliyodolula? Ulenoda male koleba. <verse eid="ROM 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ROM 8:32" />Godehe Ene Faibe koleba meyomo kaluluale. Aubale. Ehe nini sagoba ufiyofia, E-mo Ene miliyolu weasemesi mebailu. Ehe ninifea auba mololunaga, amo Ehe ninifea kanulufia, kegele noolo suniada ninifea meyobafalela? Aa, meyobafe. <verse eid="ROM 8:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ROM 8:33" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8.33 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 50:8-9">Ais 50.8-9</ref></char></note>Godehe ninimo, Ene-ba molobebeleba iminiba ufulugulu, ulenohe nini fadaayodolula? Aubada male koleba. Enebamo, Gode Ene koleba, ninimo isolu idele inolo moloba ufia labe. <verse eid="ROM 8:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ROM 8:34" />Aufia, ulenohe, ninifea fadaasia, “Ga mololusia,” nini sesia osolaba dafaliyodolula? Amoda, aubadale koleba. Enebamo, Keliso Yesu E olalu amosuale. Aubale. E olafia, <char style="w" lemma="Haiba degelu - Haiba degeba ifolu">haiba degefia</char> labe. Aulune, aga E-mo, Enao Godene sone lilibefealo yoba sigia, nini sagoba ofelesia, Godedai, ninidai, seloasia, olea labe. <verse eid="ROM 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ROM 8:35" />Kelisohe nini hamesefia, Efea kulifia labe amone, kegele ulenohe nini sogaba dafiyodolula?</para>
  <para style="b" vid="ROM 8:35" />
  <para style="li" vid="ROM 8:35">Higinilu ninifea holobagafe, amola?</para>
  <para style="li" vid="ROM 8:35">Me nini naga dife, amola?</para>
  <para style="li" vid="ROM 8:35">Me inolo nohe ninifea wolu molofe, amola?</para>
  <para style="li" vid="ROM 8:35">Me nini mamiafe, amola?</para>
  <para style="li" vid="ROM 8:35">Me nini fagulo kaeyo male adefe, amola?</para>
  <para style="li" vid="ROM 8:35">Me haloaeyo kegele nini woba ofelefe, amola?</para>
  <para style="li" vid="ROM 8:35">Me helebesihe nini dufelefe, amola?</para>
  <para style="li" vid="ROM 8:35">Hama. Kelisohe nini hamesefia Efea kulibumone sogaba dafiyodolu kegele, ulenoda male koleba.<verse eid="ROM 8:35" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ROM 8:36" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">8.36 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 44:22">Sng 44.22</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Godene bugo selesia,</para>
  <para style="b" vid="ROM 8:36" />
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 8:36">“<char style="qt">Ninimo Gafea asigi ule ufulu amo alefasia,</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 8:36">
    <char style="qt">hilia sunia, ilihe nini dufa dafaliyo mi kulifia adefe.</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 8:36">
    <char style="qt">Ilihe nini bisigia, <char style="w">dofene sibi</char> dufa dasigaba olaeyo amogulusu bolo.”</char><verse eid="ROM 8:36" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="ROM 8:37" />Auluso, Kelisohe ninifea hamesebu. Kegele amogulu ninifea holobagasenagada, hama, hilia sunia, Ehe ninimo kaamo koleba melesi moloba ofolo. <verse eid="ROM 8:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ROM 8:38" />Seale, Godehe nini bule hameselu kolebane, na kiwigaaba eweguba asigi ule ofelesu. Kegele ulenohe Godehe nini hamesebu amone sogaba dafiyodoluale.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="ROM 8:38" />
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 8:38">Olaloda, bebea saabeda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 8:38">
    <char style="w" lemma="Godene sulu dia ano">Godene sulu dia anoda</char>, gamododa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 8:38">hilia aga eweda, dufialoda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 8:38">kiwigagalu nokene nokeneba dobu amoda,<verse eid="ROM 8:38" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="ROM 8:39" />ana lagoloda, sisalo ilogoloda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 8:39">kegele sunia noolo Gode mololu dobia iwida,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 8:39">kegele amo suniahe, Gode nini hamesebu amone sogaba dafiyodoluale koleba.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 8:39">Nine <char style="w">Saminilo</char> Keliso Yesufea alefasia, Godehe nini auba hamesebuba walefe.<verse eid="ROM 8:39" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="ROM 9" />
  <para style="s">Folohe Isolaele bule koleba yagunagalu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 9:1" />Na aga gilifea saeyobasumo, ewe na-mo Kelisodai kulifia ligia, na gilifea seale selesu. Na gilifea gegeba masega selesuale. Ne <char style="w" lemma="Asigi nafulune si">asigi nafulune sihe</char>, <char style="w" lemma="Asubane Noekene">Asubane Noekenefea</char> alefasia, sulu na selesumo, sealeba saaba dafelagofe. Sulu amo ewe. <verse eid="ROM 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 9:2" />Hilia sunia, na bule yagunagasia, na bule keleba hiliseba ado. <verse eid="ROM 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 9:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9.3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 32:32">Kis 32.32</ref></char></note>Na hilisesia, nene na-mo, Yuda mosomumo, ne ibi ule amone na sagoba ufiyone auba hilisefia lolu. Aga ili Yesu <char style="w" lemma="Keliso">Kelisofea</char> kulibale ligia, kanolo sisa alebaibu. Na Yesufea kulifia lolu amone sogaba dafasia, ilihe ne hele dimesine, ilidai bedoyodolubiaga, amo na auba bedobaiyo. Aufia, nahe ilifea sagoba ofelesia, na ili bedoyone eno eweguba sogoyodolubiaga, amo na kanolo sisa alebaiyo. <verse eid="ROM 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 9:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9.4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 4:22">Kis 4.22</ref>; <ref loc="HEB 9:5">Hib 9.5</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 147:19">Sng 147.19</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 1-10">Wkp 1–10</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 15:8">Lom 15.8</ref></char></note>Maumo, ili amo <char style="w" lemma="Isolaele">Isolaele mosomu</char> alebaibu. Aufia, Godehe ili amo Ene fofolu faibili koleba melesi, dulu alebaibu. Aufia, ilimo Godene <char style="w">elalelu</char> kiwidamo abulu alebaibu. Aufia, ilimo Godehe <char style="w">oloba huliale dabalu</char> ilidai mololumo dulu alebaibu. Aufia, Godehe sulu muguli Mosesefea alefasia ilifea melune dulu alebaibu. Aufia, ili sebele moloa isoba gulugululo alebaibu. Aufia, Godehe ilifea moloyo sulu saaba waalelu alebaibu. <verse eid="ROM 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 9:5" />Aufia, ilimo wida ufulune enauwadali alebaibu. (Ili amo, Abalahamada, Aisegeda, Yekoboda.) Ine saladegelune ibi amofeafia, Kelisomo inolo holobagalu. Keliso, E-mo Gode. E-mo, kegele suniane sunialu guni labe. Hilia sunia ninihe Ene wi digiba selaba melale. <char style="sls"><char style="w">Amen</char>.</char> Auba aumale.<verse eid="ROM 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Gode E molobebelesiamo, Ene hamefeguba molobebelelo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 9:6" />
    <char style="w">Isolaele</char> mosomu noolo Kelisofea asigi ule ufulualeso, kegele lagi solu amo, aga aso hodobaifale koleba. Aso eleda dobu. Enebamo, Godene sulu saaba ufulumo auba hodobailale. Auluso, Isolaele idele inolo noolomo Godene mosomu sealeale alebaibu. <verse eid="ROM 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 9:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9.7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 21:12">Stt 21.12</ref></char></note>Aufia, <char style="w" lemma="Abalahama">Abalahamane</char> enauwadali noolomo, Abalahamane faibe sealeale. Aubale. Godehe Abalahamafea selesia, <char style="qt">“Saladegelu holobagaeyobafeba, Na oloba huliale sulu saaba ufulumo, Aisegefea alefasiasu holobagaeyobafe.”</char> <verse eid="ROM 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 9:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9.8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GAL 4:23">Gal 4.23</ref></char></note>Sulu amone mau, eweguba. Abalahamane ibifea alefasia seba dulu faibe ili amomo, Godene faibeale. Aubale. Saaba ufulu amofea asigi ule ofelesia seba dulu faibe ili amosu, Abalahamane faibeba alegalu alebaibu. <verse eid="ROM 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 9:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9.9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 18:14">Stt 18.14</ref></char></note>Godehe oloba huliale sulu Abalahamafea saaba ufulumo, ewe. <char style="qt">“Hamu no anigi, fogo iminiba ufulu adesimo, Na obegeba miyo. Fogo amimo, <char style="w">Sela</char> e-mo, inolo faibeda seba difasia, miliyobafe.”</char><verse eid="ROM 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 9:10" />Aufia, Godene sulu nomo, hilisema. <char style="w" lemma="Lebega">Lebegane</char> faibe aida guni kuliba agilu amo, fogo ule hanelu hamagahe, aalifaba ua galinolu. Aine enaomo, nine nauwa Aisege amo e. <verse eid="ROM 9:10" /><verse number="11-12" style="v" sid="ROM 9:11-12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9.11-12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 25:23">Stt 25.23</ref></char></note>Auluso, Lebegahe faibe aida amo aso seba dibale ligiamo, aaluhe mana nafuluda, mana woluda, aso molobale labi, Godehe Lebegafea eweguba solu. <char style="qt">“Siahe molomasi, olaibohe ene dabalu moloyobafe.”</char> Amone eweguba walefe. Godehe molobebelesiamo, inolo mana mololu amone alegasia, molobebelelale. Aubale. Ene hamefeguba daiyalu alefasia, E inolo welu amofea alefasia, Ehe e-mo molobebelelo. Lebegane faibe aida amone sadalu auba walefe. <verse eid="ROM 9:11-12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 9:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9.13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAL 1:2-3">Mal 1.2-3</ref></char></note>Amone iminisiamo, Godene bugohe eweguba selelu dobu.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="ROM 9:13" />
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 9:13">
    <char style="qt">“<char style="w">Yekobo</char> e-mo, Na molobebelesia, hamesefia lolu.</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 9:13">
    <char style="qt">Iso e-mo, Na molobebelesiale, afolu.”</char><verse eid="ROM 9:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 9:14" />Ausenaga, nini eneba saeyobi? Gode E molobebelesiamo, isobale molobebeleloba saeyobile? Auba saeyale. <verse eid="ROM 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 9:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9.15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 33:19">Kis 33.19</ref></char></note>Enebamo, Godehe <char style="w" lemma="Mosese">Mosesefea</char> eweguba solu.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="ROM 9:15" />
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 9:15">“<char style="qt">Na alefasia, inolo ulenofea <char style="w" lemma="Kanululo">kanuluyo</char> hamesiamo,</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 9:15">
    <char style="qt">amo Nahe efea kanululo.</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 9:15">
    <char style="qt">Aufia, Nahe inolo ulenofea yagunagayo hamesiamo,</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 9:15">
    <char style="qt">amo Nahe efea yagunagalo.</char>”<verse eid="ROM 9:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 9:16" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9.16 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EPH 2:8">Efe 2.8</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Aulugulu, Godehe inolo uleno iminiyo ligiamo, Ehe inolo ene molobaiye hamedai, ene kiwi dabalu molofe amodai, amofea alefasia iminilale. Aubale. Gode Ene <char style="w">kanululo</char> amofea alefasia, inolo iminilo.<verse eid="ROM 9:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 9:17" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9.17 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 9:16">Kis 9.16</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Ausi, sulu Godehe Isibine kini Felaufea solu amo eweguba, Godene bugo usu selelu dobu. <char style="qt">“Na alefasia, ga kini melesi gadefalumo maumo, ewe, Ne kiwigagalu bulemo, gafea waleyone aulu. Ausi, idele inolohe helefealu suniafea, Na amobuba hilisesia, Ne wi saaba sigiyobafe. Auba aumesi, Nahe ga kini melesi gadefalu.”</char><verse eid="ROM 9:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 9:18" />Aulugulu, Godehe inolo ulenofea kanuluyo hamesiamo, amo Ehe efea kanululo. Aufia, Ehe inolo uleno elelimesi moloba ufiyo hamesiamo, Ehe inolo amo elelimesi moloba ofolo.<verse eid="ROM 9:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Godene gadilodai Ene kanululodai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 9:19" />Auluso, gili ulenohe nafea eweguba saeyobafela? “Auba aulunaga, Godehe inolo auba mana molomesi moloba ufiyo hamesenaga, Ene hame amo, abe kaeyo? Gode Ene Ehe, ine mana auba molomesi moloba ufulunaga, enesi Godehe ilifea, ‘Gili heleba mololuba’ selefebi?”<verse eid="ROM 9:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 9:20" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9.20 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 29:16">Ais 29.16</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 45:9">45.9</ref></char>
    </note>Auluso, ga eweguba selesenaga, Na gafea eweguba obegeba saeyobasu. “Godene suluda auba halaleba selese ga, abegulu ligia, ause? Aga na alu asilo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9.20 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Haga sulu Baiboloda, Igilisi Baiboloda, Folo ehe iwi hele gofo mololo amofea dedeba solu. Nini Onobasulumo, alu asilo amofea dedeba selesu. Mimisililu sulu aida amone kiwi sisamo imini ule.</char></note> amone sulu besiba selesia, gilifea eweguba doba babiyobasu. Alu asulu ulenohe, ido eda asulu amofea wanesia, selesia, ‘Na henefalegulu, mau enesi, gahe na eweguba asuluba saeyobafebile?’ Saeyobafale.” <verse eid="ROM 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 9:21" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9.21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 18:6">Jer 18.6</ref></char></note>Aluda asilo ido amohe, kobaeo wedinale difasia, ene asigi kuliba abia, alu nomo, sele alu yogolelu asulu. Alu nomo, galu alu balu kegele seyone asulugulu, ido amo auba mololu amo, wolu mololubile? Aubale. E heleba molosiale, ene hame kuliba abia, alu amo asulu.<verse eid="ROM 9:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 9:22" />Gode Eda aubasu moloba labe. Seale, fisigaba dafaliyone alu noolo waa aniba diba ufulu dobu. Auluso, Godehe Ene gadilomo waleyosia, idele inolo sunia Ene kiwigagalumo bamesi hamefia ligia, E alebale sabe mesiale, fogo selale esebalo hamedofa ligia, alu amo waagi melesifia, yasifia labe. <verse eid="ROM 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 9:23" />E auba molofemo, mau ewe. Godehe idele inolo suniafea Ene <char style="w">elalelu</char> kiwida wasiga sauulu galebaisalu amo waleyo hamesia, alu noolofea kanulufia labe. Godehe alu amo Ene elalelu kiwida sesaimesi, samini waagi madenefia gadefalu.<verse eid="ROM 9:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 9:24" />Alu kanululuda diyo dobu amomo, Gode welu idele inolo nini lolu. Ehe idele inolo wesiamo, <char style="w">Yuda</char> mosomufea amifiasu weluale. Aubale. Ehe <char style="w" lemma="Yau idele inolo - Yau mosomu">yau mosomufea</char> amifiada, nini Ene melesi welu. <verse eid="ROM 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 9:25" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9.25-26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HOS 2:23">Hos 2.23</ref></char></note>Saaba ofolo inolo Hosea bugohe, Gode amo iminisia, eweguba solu.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="ROM 9:25" />
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 9:25">“<char style="qt">Idele inolo mosomu Ne-alemo, amo Nahe Ne mosomu idele inoloba saeyobasu.</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 9:25">
    <char style="qt">Ido Na hamebuale amofea, Na e hamebuba saeyobasu.</char>”<verse eid="ROM 9:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 9:26" />“<char style="qt">Aufia, samini ilifea Ne mosomualeba saaba ufuluiya helea hamagi, ili Gode bebea labe amone faibeba saeyobafe.</char>”<verse eid="ROM 9:26" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 9:27" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9.27-28 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 10:22-23">Ais 10.22-23</ref>
      </char>
    </note>
    <char style="w" lemma="Aisaia">Aisaiahe</char> <char style="w">Isolaele</char> idele inolo asigisia, yeeba dafelagosia, eweguba solu,</para>
  <para style="b" vid="ROM 9:27" />
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 9:27">“<char style="qt">Isolaele idele inolo wedinale bulesia, ili amone alegalumo hano saiigulu alebaisenagada, hama.</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 9:27">
    <char style="qt">
      <char style="w" lemma="Gasiba dafelagoba dilo">Gasiba dafelagoba obegeba diyobafe</char> ili amone alegalumo, afolu haisi amo, wedidenosu alegaeyobafe.</char><verse eid="ROM 9:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 9:28" />
    <char style="qt">
      <char style="w" lemma="Saminilo">Saminilohe</char> helefealu iwi Ene solu amoguba, ogoba sisiba moloba samodoyobafe.”</char><verse eid="ROM 9:28" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 9:29" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9.29 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 1:9">Ais 1.9</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Aufia, samini Aisaiahe sulu noolo eweguba solu.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="ROM 9:29" />
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 9:29">
    <char style="qt">“Saminilo Kiwigagaluda amohe ninifea saladegelu sebe faibe huliane afolualebiaga,</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 9:29">
    <char style="qt">ninimo <char style="w" lemma="Sodomo">Sodomodai</char>, Gomoladai, waagulu adesia, ninida sunia yasoba danebaiyo.”</char><verse eid="ROM 9:29" /></para>
  <para style="s">Isolaele ili asigi ule ufiyomo babealu alebaibu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 9:30" />Aulugulu, nini eneba saeyobi? <char style="w" lemma="Yau idele inolo - Yau mosomu">Yau idele inolo</char> ilimo, Godene si saabia isolu miliyo migagaba dedalelualeso, aga ine <char style="w">asigi ule ufulu</char> amofea alefasia, Godehe ili, Edai isolu melesi moloba ufulu. <verse eid="ROM 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 9:31" />Auluso, <char style="w">Isolaele</char> idele inolo Godene si saabia isolu miliyofia, <char style="w">muguli</char> sulu kuliba maiyone migagaba dedalelu ili amo, maiyo aafea ami goaluale.<verse eid="ROM 9:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ROM 9:32" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9.32 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 8:14">Ais 8.14</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Ili ami goalualemo, enesi aulubi? Maumo, ili asigi ule ufiyone eno amo abiale, mana nafulu moloyone eno amo daalune aulu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ROM 9:32">Auba aasimo, Yuda ilihe abane inolone emoda sauwalo amofea, emo sauwasia gelebailu. <verse eid="ROM 9:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ROM 9:33" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9.33 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 28:16">Ais 28.16</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:10">Mag 12.10</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 4:11">HD 4.11</ref>; <ref loc="EPH 2:20">Efe 2.20</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 3:11">1Kld 3.11</ref>; <ref loc="1PE 2:6-8">1Fid 2.6-8</ref></char></note>Godene bugohe amone iminisia eweguba selelu dobu.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="ROM 9:33" />
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 9:33">“<char style="qt">Gili bama! Nahe Saiono galea ami abane ule diba dobu.</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 9:33">
    <char style="qt">Aufia, idele inolo noolo abane amofea emo sauwasia gelebaiyobafe.</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 9:33">
    <char style="qt">Auluso, idele inolo Efea <char style="w" lemma="Asigi ule ufulu">asigi ule ofelefemo</char>, yuaeyobafale.</char>”<verse eid="ROM 9:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="ROM 10" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 10:1" />Ne damenedali, Gode Ehe Isolaele idele inolomo sagoba ofelesia, <char style="w" lemma="Gasiba dafelagoba dilo">gasiba dafelagoba</char> obegeba dimalebaiyesia, nahe hilia sunia <char style="w" lemma="Godedai sulu selefe">Godedai sulu selaba</char> lolu. <verse eid="ROM 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 10:2" />Ili Godene hame isaeyone, migagaba mololabia dedalefe amone, na sulu ulufaba saaba dafelagosu. Auluso, ili babeaba adesia, heleba migagaba dedaleba labe. <verse eid="ROM 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 10:3" />Maumo, isolu mana Godefeafia saabemo, ili nafuluba fadaba asigisiale, ili ine mana nafulu mololo koleba alefasia, isolu miliyone migagaba dedalefe. Auba molosia, ilimo ine meleba Gode sisa ufulualene, Ehe ilimo Edai isolu melesi moloba ufiyodoluale. <verse eid="ROM 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 10:4" />Mosesene sulu muguli saaba ufulumo, Yesu <char style="w">Keliso</char> Ehe ililiba samodofia wasolu. Aulugulu, idele inolo Efea asigi ule ufulumo, Godehe ili isolu melesi moloba ofelefe.<verse eid="ROM 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Idele inolo suniane gasiba dafelagoba dilo amo, Keliso E labe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 10:5" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10.5 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LEV 18:5">Wkp 18.5</ref>
      </char>
    </note>
    <char style="w">Muguli</char> sulu kuliba daaba ligia, Godedai isolusu koleba miliyone selesiamo, <char style="w" lemma="Mosese">Mosesehe</char> eweguba selelu.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="ROM 10:5" />
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 10:5">“<char style="qt">Inolo abehe, muguli sulu amo nafuluba kuliba daaba moloba yaalumo,</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 10:5">
    <char style="qt">miliyolu miliyo disia, bebea misiyobafe.</char>”<verse eid="ROM 10:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 10:6" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10.6-8 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 30:12-14">Lo 30.12-14</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Auluso, inolo abehe ene <char style="w" lemma="Asigi ule ufulu">asigi ule ufulumo</char> saabia ami kalugaafia ligia, Godene si saabia isolusu adefe amo, e, sulu eweguba saeyobafe. “Gine asigine libo usu hilisesia, eweguba doba baaba samabiyo. <char style="qt">Abehe <char style="w">Hebene</char> lagi felaeyobafe?</char>” Auba samabiyoba selefemone mau, ewe. Auba selesenaga, gili gine kiwidai, hamedai, amofea alefasia koleba, hebene felafia, Keliso ulubia suga miyogulu adefe.<verse eid="ROM 10:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 10:7" />Aufia, isolu inolo amohe saabia selesia, ewegubada samabiyoba saeyobafe. “<char style="qt">Abehe hele kaleba gogolu bule daneluda asela ami sugaeyobafe?</char>” Auba selesenaga, gili gine kiwidai, gine hamedai, amofea alefasia, sugafia, Keliso danelu asela amifia ulubia fela miyogulu adefe. Aulune, auba samabiyolu.<verse eid="ROM 10:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 10:8" />Auluso, isolu inolohe auba samabusenaga, amo ehe sulu hala saamaba selefe? Sulu amo eweguba saama. <char style="qt">“Sulumo hagoale, ga labea mulu ligia, ge mofeo usu amida, ge asigine libo usu amida, ufulu dobu.</char>” Sulu amomo, asigi ule ufiyo sulu nini waleba alolu amofea iminife. <verse eid="ROM 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 10:9" />Amone ge mofeohe, Yesu E <char style="w">Saminilo</char> labeba ulufaba saaba dafelagosenaga, Godehe ga <char style="w" lemma="Gasiba dafelagoba dilo">gasiba dafelagoba obegeba dife</char>. Godehe Yesu E olaiyafia degeba ifolu. Ge asigine libohe amofea <char style="w" lemma="Asigi ule ufulu">asigi ule ofelesenaga</char>, amofea alefasia, Godehe ga gasiba dafelagoba obegeba dife. <verse eid="ROM 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 10:10" />Enebamo, ga asigi ule ofelesiamo, gahe ge asigine libo usu iligi, asigi ule ofolo. Amo alefasia, Godehe ga Edai isolu melesiba moloba ofolo. Aufia, ga sulu ulufaba saaba dafelagosiamo, ge mofeohe saaba dafelagolo. Aida amofea alefasia, Godehe ga <char style="w" lemma="Gasiba dafelagoba dilo">gasiba dafelagoba</char> dilo.<verse eid="ROM 10:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 10:11" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10.11 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 28:16">Ais 28.16</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 9:33">Lom 9.33</ref></char>
    </note>Godene bugohe kegele amone iminisia, eweguba selefe. <char style="qt">“Idele inolo sunia abehe, Efea asigi ule ofelefemo, ili yuaeyobafale”.</char> <verse eid="ROM 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 10:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10.12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 15:9">HD 15.9</ref></char></note>Aulugulu, <char style="w" lemma="Yuda">Yudada</char>, Yau idele inoloda, ili amo imini ule labe. Saminilo ule E-su, mosomu suniane Saminilo labe. Idele inolo suniahe Saminilofeada sagoba homafe ili amo, Ehe bule koleba ediliba ufiyobafe. <verse eid="ROM 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 10:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10.13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOL 3:5">Jol 3.5</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 2:21">HD 2.21</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 9:14">9.14</ref></char></note>Enebamo, Godene bugohe eweguba selelu dobu. “<char style="qt">Idele inolo sunia abehe Saminilofea sagoba homasimo, Ehe ili amo gasiba dafelagoba obegeba diyobafe.”</char><verse eid="ROM 10:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 10:14" />Auluso, idele inolo Efea asigi ule ofale ligiamo, Efea sagoba homaba eneba saeyobi? Aufia, idele inolohe Ene sulu dobale ligiamo, Efea halaguba asigi ule ufiyobi? Inolo ulenohe ilifea walesalenaga, ili amo eneba dubiyobafebi? <verse eid="ROM 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 10:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10.15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 52:7">Ais 52.7</ref></char></note>Aufia, ulenohe walemesifia hilibaisalenaga, amo ili Godene sulu mana eneba waleyobi? Godene bugohe eweguba seleba dobu. “<char style="qt">Inolo Awalu Sulu Nafulu dia saabe, amone emomo yogolelu koleba labe.</char>”<verse eid="ROM 10:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Isolaele ili noolohe Awalu Sulu Nafulu amo duluale</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 10:16" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10.16 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 53:1">Ais 53.1</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Auluso, idele inolo noolo suniahe Awalu Sulu Nafulu amo sigidubuluale. Enebamo, <char style="w" lemma="Aisaia">Aisaia</char> selesia, <char style="qt">“Saminilo, nini sulu solumo dofasia, sigidubulu inolo uleno labela? Male koleba.”</char> <verse eid="ROM 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 10:17" />Aulugulu, eweguba labe. Uleno ilifea Godene sulu mana walesalenaga, ili dubiyobafale. Ili dobelesalenaga, <char style="w" lemma="Asigi ule ufulu">asigi ule ufiyobafale</char>. Aubale. Kelisone awalu sulu nafulu dobelefe amosu alefasia, inolohe asigi ule ufiyobafe.<verse eid="ROM 10:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 10:18" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10.18 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 19:4">Sng 19.4</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Auluso, na amone doba bosolumo, Isolaele idele inolo ili Awalu Sulu Nafulu amo dubulualebile? Aubale. Ilimo dobalaba yaalubu. Enebamo, Godene bugomo eweguba selelu dobu.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="ROM 10:18" />
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 10:18">“<char style="qt">Sulu amone goo amo abia, helefealune hele kulia sunia doba sigiba yaalu.</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 10:18">
    <char style="qt">Sulu amo abia, helefealu idele inolo sunia kakainabia dobolaba yaalu.”</char><verse eid="ROM 10:18" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 10:19" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10.19 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 32:21">Lo 32.21</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Aulugulu, ili dobolaba yaalunaga, na haiba saabia doba bosolu. <char style="w">Isolaele</char> idele inolo ilihe sulu amo dofasia, asigiba dulualebile? Aa, ili asigiba duluso, ili sulu amofea asigi ule ufuluale. Maugaba <char style="w" lemma="Mosese">Mosesehe</char> amone iminiba selesia,</para>
  <para style="b" vid="ROM 10:19" />
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 10:19">
    <char style="qt">“Godehe eweguba solu. </char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 10:19">
    <char style="qt">‘Isolaele gilimo, kegele diyo hilisefia mesegemesifia, Nahe yau idele inolo, ne mosomuale amone sagoba ufiyobasu.</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 10:19">
    <char style="qt">Gili habomesifia, Nahe babealu mosomu idele inolo amone sagoba ufiyo.’ ”</char><verse eid="ROM 10:19" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 10:20" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10.20 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 65:1">Ais 65.1</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Aufia, Aisaiane mofeofeada, Godehe sulu kiwigaaba eweguba solu.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="ROM 10:20" />
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 10:20">
    <char style="qt">“Idele inolo Nada isaluale ilihe. Na baaba golelu.</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 10:20">
    <char style="qt">Idele inolo Na labelaba doba abuluale ilifeamo, Nene Nahe ulufaba walelu.”</char><verse eid="ROM 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 10:21" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10.21 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 65:2">Ais 65.2</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Auluso, Isolaele idele inolo amone saaba, Aisaiane mofeofea alefasia, Godehe eweguba solu.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="ROM 10:21" />
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 10:21">
    <char style="qt">“Idele inolo elelisia, Ne suluda saidafelefe ilifeamo,</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 10:21">
    <char style="qt">hilia sunia ilimo Na labea obegeba milalebaiyesia,</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 10:21">
    <char style="qt">Nahe Ne sone feafia lolu.”</char><verse eid="ROM 10:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="ROM 11" />
  <para style="s">Godehe Isolaele mosomu idele inolo afolale koleba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 11:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11.1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1SA 12:22">1Sml 12.22</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 94:14">Sng 94.14</ref>; <ref loc="PHP 3:5">Fil 3.5</ref></char>
    </note>Aulugulu, na eweguba doba bosolu. Gode Ehe Ene mosomu idele inolomo afolula? Aa, E auba mololale. Na-mo, na Folo, nene nada <char style="w" lemma="Isolaele">Isolaele inolo</char>. Ne nauwa <char style="w" lemma="Abalahama">Abalahamane</char> ibifea alefasia holobagalu ulenomo, na. Na Benisamenene mosomu inolo lolu.<verse eid="ROM 11:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 11:2" />Samini waagi Godehe <char style="w">Isolaele</char> mosomu Ene idele inolo melesi saaba ufulu. Sulu auba saaba ufulu amo, E afoluale. Elaiyane sadalu Godene bugo selelu dobumo, gilihe obegeba asigima. Ehe Godefea Isolaele idele inolo heleba mololuba fadaasiamo, eweguba solu. <verse eid="ROM 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 11:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11.3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 19:10">1Kin 19.10</ref>, <ref loc="1KI 19:14">14</ref></char></note>“<char style="qt"><char style="w">Saminilo</char>, ilihe Ge <char style="w">saaba ofolo</char> inolo ilimo yasoba danefia, Gafea <char style="w" lemma="Soba meyone defene olabolu">soba meyone defene olabolumo</char> gogoleba dafalilu. Ausi, ule nelebisu huliane afolu lolu. Yeele! Aufia, aga ilihe nada dufa olaeyo weiyaafe.</char>” <verse eid="ROM 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 11:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11.4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 19:18">1Kin 19.18</ref></char></note>Elaiya auba selesi, Godehe efea eweguba obegeba solubiyo. “<char style="qt">Doma. Inolo saii domoba (7,000) Nahe Ne-ba iminifia, Nene Nafealo melesisia, huliane afolu alebaimesi gadefabu. Ilihe masega gode Baalifea emo hugulumo sagaba gulugululale.</char>”<verse eid="ROM 11:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 11:5" />Amogubasu, aga iwida, Godehe <char style="w">kanululo</char> ulu mefia, Isolaele mosomu huliane afolu bilalemo Ene-ba molobebelefia, Efealo alebaimesi gadefabu. <verse eid="ROM 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 11:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11.6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GAL 3:18">Gal 3.18</ref></char></note>Na sulu kiwi eweguba selesu. Doma. Godehe Ene kanululo ulu mefia, Isolaele huliane afolu idele inolo molobebelelu. Nini auba selesenaga, amo eweguba selesuale. Ine mana nafulu mololu amo alegasia, Godehe ilifea sabe mesia, molobebeleluba selesuale. Aubale. Ene kanululo alefasia, ulu mesia molobebeleluba selesu. Enebamo, na selesiamo, Godehe ilifea sabe mefeba selesiabiaga, Ehe kanululo ulu mefeba sabaiyale.<verse eid="ROM 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 11:7" />Ausenaga, nini eneba saeyobi? Kegele Isolaele ilihe amo dibaiyeba hogololu dabalu mololuso, amo ili duluale. Auluso, ili aleba ami, Godehe molobebelelu idele inolo, ilisu kegele amo dulu. Auluso, ili noolomo, ine libo kaaba dafalilu. <verse eid="ROM 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 11:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11.8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 29:4">Lo 29.4</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 29:10">Ais 29.10</ref></char></note>Amone iminisia, Godene bugo selesia,</para>
  <para style="b" vid="ROM 11:8" />
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 11:8">“<char style="qt">Godehe ili haneba kalolugulu moloba waalelu.</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 11:8">
    <char style="qt">Ehe ine simo bamesiale moloba waalelu.</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 11:8">
    <char style="qt">Aufia, ine konenihe sulu domesiale moloba waalelu. </char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 11:8">
    <char style="qt">Ili auba adabia inigia, aga iwida aubasu alebaibu.</char>”<verse eid="ROM 11:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 11:9" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11.9-10 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 69:22-23">Sng 69.22-23</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Aufia, <char style="w">Deibidi</char> eda amone saaba eweguba holobagamesi hamefeba solu.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="ROM 11:9" />
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 11:9">“<char style="qt">Ili naiyo bule naiyone gagaiyofea fogo amimo, ili kani helelu wadoguba, walemesi hamefe.</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 11:9">
    <char style="qt">Aufia, ili amone elebe sabe disiamo, koo wadoguba, walemesi hamefe.</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 11:9">
    <char style="qt">Ili abanefea emo sauwasia gelebaisamesi hamefe.</char><verse eid="ROM 11:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 11:10" />
    <char style="qt">Ili bamesiale, ine si kalaba waalemesi hamefe.</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 11:10">
    <char style="qt">Aufia, ili faiso kowefiasu melesi hamefe.</char>”</para>
  <para style="b" vid="ROM 11:10" />
  <para style="m" vid="ROM 11:10">Deibidi ehe auba holobagamalebaiyeba solu.<verse eid="ROM 11:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Godehe mosomu noolo gasiba dafelagoba obegeba dulu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 11:11" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11.11 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 13:46">HD 13.46</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Aulune, na saabia eweguba doba bosolu. “Isolaele ili abane amofea emo sauwasiamo, ili woba dafelesia gelebaisalula?” <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11.11 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Abane amofea emo sauwalo</char><char style="ft" closed="false">ba selefe amo, Yesu E. </char></note> Auba auluale koleba. Ili gelebailumo eno amofea alefasia, Godehe <char style="w" lemma="Yau idele inolo - Yau mosomu">yau mosomu</char> idele inolo noolo <char style="w" lemma="Gasiba dafelagoba dilo">gasiba dafelagoba</char> obegeba dulu. Gode Ehe mana nafulu mosomu noolofea molofe amo Isolaele ili bafasia, hidigisia, mesegemesisia mololu. <verse eid="ROM 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 11:12" />Isolaele idele inolohe heleba dedalesimo, Godehe helefealu idele inolo bule koleba sagoba ofelefe. Aufia, Isolaelehe Godene mana afelesimo, Godehe yau idele inolofea mana nafulu koleba molofe. Auluso, Isolaele ili sunia Godefea obegeba yaasimo, fogo ami, Godene edililo samini ediliba ufulu amo, wasigasia suniaeyobafe.<verse eid="ROM 11:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 11:13" />Aga nahe yau idele inolo gilifea eweguba selesu. Godehe na-mo, gili aleba ami, hilibailu dabalu molomesi hilibaiso. Aulugulu, dabalu na molosu amo, olaibogulu, na heneba ligia molosu. <verse eid="ROM 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 11:14" />Dabalu na molosu ewemo, nahe ne damene ibi ule ili koleba hidigiba bamesisia molosu. Aufia, ili amo bafasia, dibaiyeba mesegesia, noolo asigi besiyobafe. Ausi, Godehe ili <char style="w" lemma="Gasiba dafelagoba dilo">gasiba dafelagoba obegeba diyobafe</char>. Auba aumesisia, na hame diba ofolagofia yasiba ligia, dabalu ewe moloba lolu.<verse eid="ROM 11:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 11:15" />Yuda mosomu ilihe Godene ulu melu kegele diyo habolu. Ili ulu kegele auba diyo habosihe eno sogosia, helefealu sunia Godedai hilise ule ofelesia, helegeba kakainamesi mololu. Aufasia, ili koleba nolofia, Godefealo obegesia, Ene ulu kegele heneba disi, olalu inolo haiba obegeba degeba yaalugulu miliyobafe.<verse eid="ROM 11:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Olifi i sealedai, olifi i aaledai, amone besi solu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 11:16" />Nolu selu uleno amo gaduafia, Godefea <char style="w">sebe olaibo</char> balu mesenaga, haisi gadualu amo <char style="w">muuba kalilu</char> alolu. Aufia, nolu selu amoda sunia muuba kalilu adefe. I ulenone seme amo muuba kalilu noekene labenaga, amo i odo amoda sunia muuba kalilu noekene adaaba yaafe.<verse eid="ROM 11:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 11:17" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11.17 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EPH 2:11-19">Efe 2.11-19</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Isolaele mosomu inemo, <char style="w" lemma="Olifi">olifi i</char> seale sebe nafulu geba ufulu amogulu labe. Aufasia, Yau mosomu amo, olifi i ilosisa aale sobolu amogulu labe. Olifi seale nafulu i amone odo noolo sogaba dafalilu dobu. Aufia labi, Godehe gili kauugulu, olifi aale i amofea sogaba difasia, olifi seale amone odo noolo sabufea aso labea olea ami kuliba ufulu. Gilida sabufea ami kulifia ligia, sobomesi aulu. Aulugulu, gili sabu amofea auba kulifia ligia, olifi amone seme hano saafeda nafulu ua osolaba diaba yaabu.<verse eid="ROM 11:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 11:18" />Auba aubunaga, sabufea hili kulilu aale kauu gilimo, gilihe i odo ami samini waagi alolu ilimo wasolubusia, kaiimabiyo. Enebamo, asigima! Gilihe seme kiwigaaba ofolale. Aubale. Seme amohe gili kiwigaaba ofelesia, miliyolu hano melo.<verse eid="ROM 11:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 11:19" />Auluso, na hilisesia, gilihe eweguba saeyobafebile, “Nini i sabu amofea kulimesi fogo mesiamo, odo noolo sogaba dafalilubiyo.” <verse eid="ROM 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 11:20" />Amo gili seale auba selefeso, gili eweguba asigima. Ili sogaba dafalilu maumo, ili <char style="w" lemma="Asigi ule ufulu">asigi ule ufulualene</char> aulu. Gili aga i sabufea kukulifia labemo, gine asigi ule ufulu amofea alefasiasu labe. Aulugulu, gine meleba wasolu lolusia, kaiimabiyo. Gilida aubasu haiba sogaba dafolosi, momoleba hilisesia, sagiliba melale. <verse eid="ROM 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 11:21" />Enebamo, olifi seale i amone odo koleba ilihe, asigi ule ufulu afelesi, Godehe ilifea waagi kulifia melesi gadefaluale. Aufia, ilosisa olifi aalene kauu gilida, amogubasu asigi ule ufulu afelesenaga, Ehe gilimo waagi kulifia melesi gadefaeyobafeba hilisefela? Aa, auba hilisemabiyo. Gilida asigi ule ufulu afelesi, Godehe aubasu waagi kulifia melesi gadefaeyobafale.<verse eid="ROM 11:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 11:22" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11.22 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JHN 15:2">Yon 15.2</ref>, <ref loc="JHN 15:4">4</ref></char>
    </note>Aulugulu, gilihe Gode Ene mana nafulu heafuba mololo amodai, mana kolelu E mololo amodaimo, gili nafuluba asigima. Idele inolo ilihe Ene mana amo afelesia, hodobaisalu ili amofea Ehe mana sodo. Auluso, gilimo Ene mana nafulu amofea kulifiasu adesenaga, Ehe gilifea mana nafulu heafuba mololo. Auluso, nafuluba. Ehe gilida sogaba dafalilosi.<verse eid="ROM 11:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 11:23" />Yuda idele inolo ili nolofia, asigi ule ufiyo obegesenaga, amo Godehe ilida i sabu amofea haiba sobomesi obegeba kuliba ufiyobafe. Seale koleba, Godehe auba kuliba ufiyodolu labe. <verse eid="ROM 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 11:24" />Yau idele inolo gili, Godehe samini gilimo <char style="w">olifi</char> i aale ilosisa alolu amofea sogaba dafasia, olifi seale i sebe nafulu helelo amofea kuliba ufulu. Seale, sabu amo gineale. Godehe gili auba sabu amofea kuliba ufiyodolunaga, amo nini hilisesiamo, Ehe olifi seale i odo Yuda ilimo, ine sabufea koleba haiba obegeba kuliba ufiyodolu seale labeba hilisebu.<verse eid="ROM 11:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Godehe Isolaele momolosia, ili gasiba dafelagoba diyobafe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 11:25" />Ne damenedali, gili koleba wasolu lolusia kaiilosi, na-mo gilihe mugusilu ewe nafuluba asigimesi hamefe. Mugusilu amo eweguba,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ROM 11:25">
    <char style="w">Isolaele</char> mosomu osolaba noolone asigidai, libodai, kaafiasu ligia, <char style="w" lemma="Yau idele inolo - Yau mosomu">yau idele inolo</char> Godefea asigi ule ofelefe amone alegalu lilisia, wasigaaba samodosi, eloyobafe. <verse eid="ROM 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 11:26" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11.26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 59:20-21">Ais 59.20-21</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 27:9">27.9</ref></char></note>Aufia kaalumo auba sogosi, Godehe Isolaele idele inolo sunia <char style="w" lemma="Gasiba dafelagoba dilo">gasiba dafelagoba obegeba diyobafe</char>. Amone iminisia, Godene bugohe eweguba selelu dobu.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="ROM 11:26" />
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 11:26">
    <char style="qt">“Idele inoloda Sububa Dafogoyo Inolo Amomo, Saiono galea ami maugafia miyobafe.</char>
    <note caller="+" style="f">
      <char style="fr" closed="false">11.26 </char>
      <char style="fq" closed="false">Saiono gale </char>
      <char style="ft" closed="false">amoba selefemo, Isolaele mosomu iminisia selefe.</char>
    </note></para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 11:26">
    <char style="qt">Aufia, Ehe <char style="w" lemma="Yekobo">Yekobone</char> saladegelu ili Godeda faiso mesia waalefemo, Ene haiba noloba waaleyobafe.”</char><verse eid="ROM 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 11:27" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11.27 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 31:33-34">Jer 31.33-34</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Aufia, Gode eweguba solu.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="ROM 11:27" />
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 11:27">
    <char style="qt">“Nahe Ne <char style="w">oloba huliale dabalu</char> ilidai moloyoba solumo, ewe.</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 11:27">
    <char style="qt">Ili woba mololumo diba dafalisia, Na ili momoloyoba solu.”</char><verse eid="ROM 11:27" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 11:28" />Aga Isolaele mosomu ilihe Yesune Awalu Sulu Nafulu amofea faiso melu amo alefasia, ilimo Godefea gisa alebaibu. Amohe yau mosomu idele inolo gili milibaimesi, eno sogoba ofelefe. Auluso, samini waagi Godehe Isolaele mosomu Ene-ba melesi molobebelelu amo alefasia, ilimo Godene hameselu koleba alebaibu. Amone maumo ewe, Godehe ine enauwadali, Abalahamada, Aisegeda, Yekoboda, ilifea oloba huliale sulu saaba ufulu. <verse eid="ROM 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 11:29" />Mau enebamo, Godehe idele inolo E labea milesi wesia, aufia Ehe ulu kegele nafulu meba ligiamo, Ene asigi haiba no dedegelale.<verse eid="ROM 11:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 11:30" />Saminimo, yau gili Godene sulu saidafelaba alolu. Auluso, Isolaele idele inolo ilihe aga Godene sulu saidafelesi, eno amo alefasia, aga yau gilihe, Godene <char style="w">kanululo</char> dulu. <verse eid="ROM 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 11:31" />Amogubasu agamo, Isolaele idele inolo ilida Godene sulu saidafolaba adesi, Godene <char style="w">kanululo</char> gili dulu ogo alefasia, ilida Godene kanululo haiba diyobafe. <verse eid="ROM 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ROM 11:32" />Enebamo, Godehe idele inolo sunia sulu saidafolo mana amone selege amo waagi ua walolu melesi gadefalu. Ausiane, Ehe idele inolo suniafea kanulusiane aulu.<verse eid="ROM 11:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">Godene wi digiba saama</para>
  <para style="qc">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ROM 11:33" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11.33 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 55:8-9">Ais 55.8-9</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Wae!</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="ROM 11:33">Momolelu kegele dobu sunia,</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="ROM 11:33">Gode Ene koleba.</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="ROM 11:33">Ene asigiloda, dawaloloda,</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="ROM 11:33">dobumo eloyo male.</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="ROM 11:33">Godehe osolasia daiyalumo</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="ROM 11:33">uleno babeasia,</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="ROM 11:33">Ene emo emelalu buu</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="ROM 11:33">kuliba maiyo babealu ado.<verse eid="ROM 11:33" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="ROM 11:34" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11.34 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 40:13">Ais 40.13</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 2:16">1Kld 2.16</ref></char>
    </note>Amone iminisia, Godene bugo selesia,</para>
  <para style="b" vid="ROM 11:34" />
  <para style="qc" vid="ROM 11:34">
    <char style="qt">“Saminilone asigimo, </char></para>
  <para style="qc" vid="ROM 11:34">
    <char style="qt">abe alefasia dawaloyobi?</char></para>
  <para style="qc" vid="ROM 11:34">
    <char style="qt">Me abe alefasia asigi Efea melobi?”</char><verse eid="ROM 11:34" /></para>
  <para style="qc">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ROM 11:35" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11.35 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 41:11">Jop 41.11</ref>
      </char>
    </note>
    <char style="qt">“Gode Efeago, </char></para>
  <para style="qc" vid="ROM 11:35">
    <char style="qt">abe alefasia kegele maugaba mesi,</char></para>
  <para style="qc" vid="ROM 11:35">
    <char style="qt">amone Godehe </char></para>
  <para style="qc" vid="ROM 11:35">
    <char style="qt">obegeba efea sabe melobile?</char></para>
  <para style="qc" vid="ROM 11:35">
    <char style="qt">Aubada uleno male koleba.”</char><verse eid="ROM 11:35" /></para>
  <para style="qc">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ROM 11:36" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11.36 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1CO 8:6">1Kld 8.6</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Maumo, Gode Enefea alefasia</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="ROM 11:36">kegele sunia moloba dafelagobu.</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="ROM 11:36">Aufia, E-mo kegele suniane</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="ROM 11:36">mau labe.</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="ROM 11:36">Aufia, kegele sunia</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="ROM 11:36">Ene koleba labe.</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="ROM 11:36">
    <char style="w" lemma="Elalelu">Elalelumo,</char></para>
  <para style="qc" vid="ROM 11:36">Efea alefalu alefaeyobafe.</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="ROM 11:36">
    <char style="sls">
      <char style="w">Amen</char>.</char> Amo seale koleba.<verse eid="ROM 11:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="ROM 12" />
  <para style="s">Seale gulugulusiamo, gene ga Godefea memale</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 12:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12.1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ROM 6:11">Lom 6.11</ref>, <ref loc="ROM 6:13">13</ref>; <ref loc="1PE 2:5">1Fid 2.5</ref></char>
    </note>Auba aulune, ne damenedali, Godene kanululo bule amone nini bafasia, na gilifea kiwigaaba eweguba selesu. Gili koleba, gine domala ogo Efea ulu soba melo kegelegulu memale. Na auba selesumo, gahe ge domala dufasia, soba memaba selesualeso, ge domalane mana ogo, Gode Ene iminiba ufulu adesia, E henemesi, Efea bebea memale. Mana amo, Godefea gulugulusia seale mololomo amo. <verse eid="ROM 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 12:2" />Gili koleba helefealu idele inolo waagulu alefasia, mana molologuba mololabia daaba melabiyo. Auluso, gine asigi hagaea dedegelabia aafe amohe, hili galinolabia adabia daaba melale. Auba ausiamo, gilihe Godene hamemo nafuluba osolasia, eloba babiyobafe. Godene hamemo, ewe. Mana nafuluda, Gode henemesi moloyoda, helegeba moloyoda, Gode E nini auba molomalebaiyeba hamefe.<verse eid="ROM 12:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sesemo Kelisone domalagulu labe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 12:3" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12.3 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1CO 12:11">1Kld 12.11</ref>; <ref loc="EPH 4:7">Efe 4.7</ref>; <ref loc="PHP 2:3">Fil 2.3</ref></char>
    </note>Godehe ulu mesia, nafea kanululumo alefasia, nahe sulu ewe gili sunia elebi elebibafea selesu. Gili koleba gine meleba eweguba osolaba bamale. Gode alefasia, gafea <char style="w" lemma="Asigi ule ufulu">asigi ule homesi</char> melu ogo eloba bamale. Aufia, gili auba eloba bisigia, noolo anogo wasolu loluba kaiimabiyo.<verse eid="ROM 12:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 12:4" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12.4 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1CO 12:12">1Kld 12.12</ref>, <ref loc="1CO 12:27">27</ref></char>
    </note>Na aga dedeba selesumo, ewe. Nini asigibu, domala ule amofea haisi nonoba labe. Haisi haisiba amomo, sunia dabalu ulesu mololale. <verse eid="ROM 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 12:5" />Amogubasu, nini idele inoloda wedinale alebaibu. Auluso, Kelisodai kulifia adesimo, nini sunia domala ule koleba lolu. Nini auba ligia, elebi elebiba, domala amone haisi nonoba alebaibu. <verse eid="ROM 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 12:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12.6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 12:4-11">1Kld 12.4-11</ref>; <ref loc="1PE 4:10-11">1Fid 4.10-11</ref></char></note>Enebamo, Godehe Ene <char style="w">kanululo</char> amone iminifia, Ehe nini ule ulebafea dawalolo nonoba meba yaalu. Dawalolo amo ewe.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="ROM 12:6" />
  <para style="li1" vid="ROM 12:6">Gode alefasia, gafea saaba ofa sulu saeyone dawalolo melunaga,</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="ROM 12:6">amo ga kolebamo asigi ule ufulune mana imini dobuguba, auba saaba ofa saamale.<verse eid="ROM 12:6" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 12:7" />Aufia, gahe no anogo sagoba ufiyone dawalolo sebunaga,</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="ROM 12:7">amo sagoba ofolaba melale.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="ROM 12:7">Aufia, gahe waleyone dawalolo sebunaga,</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="ROM 12:7">amo waleba melale.<verse eid="ROM 12:7" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 12:8" />Aufia, gahe none asigi kiwigaaba ofa waaleyone dawalolo sebunaga,</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="ROM 12:8">amo gahe kiwigaaba ofa waaleba melale.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="ROM 12:8">Aufia, gahe meyone dawalolo sebunaga,</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="ROM 12:8">amo gahe gene seba alebale, mebasu melale.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="ROM 12:8">Aufia, gahe uluba miliyone dawalolo sebunaga,</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="ROM 12:8">amo gahe helegeba uluba adabasu melale.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="ROM 12:8">Aufia, gahe no anogo yagunagafia, sagoba ufiyone dawalolo sebunaga,</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="ROM 12:8">amo gahe heafuba auba molobasu melale.<verse eid="ROM 12:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mana nafulu molomalelu sulu amone moloba waleyo</para>
  <para style="li3">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 12:9" />Hamesesiamo, seale hamesesuba hamesemale.</para>
  <para style="li3" vid="ROM 12:9">Aufia, mana wolufea golaba bisigia, faiso memale.</para>
  <para style="li3" vid="ROM 12:9">Aufia, mana nafulufea adagilifia, seba fedofia melale.<verse eid="ROM 12:9" /></para>
  <para style="li3">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 12:10" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12.10 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1PE 1:22">1Fid 1.22</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Aufia, gine geleba hamesesiamo, onaba hamesemale.</para>
  <para style="li3" vid="ROM 12:10">Aufia, gili aleba no sisa hamedofa melale.<verse eid="ROM 12:10" /></para>
  <para style="li3">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 12:11" />Aufia, migagaba molobaiyelomo, habalomabiyo.</para>
  <para style="li3" vid="ROM 12:11">Aufia, ge asubanene de ogo waiyaba melale.</para>
  <para style="li3" vid="ROM 12:11">Aufia, <char style="w" lemma="Saminilo">Saminilone</char> dabalu helegeba molomale.<verse eid="ROM 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="li3">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 12:12" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12.12 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1TH 5:16-18">1Des 5.16-18</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Aufia, <char style="w" lemma="Hame diba ofogosia yasiyo">hame diba ofogofia</char>, henefiasu yasiba melale.</para>
  <para style="li3" vid="ROM 12:12">Aufia, higinilu holobagasi, esebalo gadaeaba melale.</para>
  <para style="li3" vid="ROM 12:12">Aufia, <char style="w" lemma="Godedai sulu selefe">Godedai sulu selesiamo</char>, afelesiale fedoba sefia ligia, selaba melale.<verse eid="ROM 12:12" /></para>
  <para style="li3">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 12:13" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12.13 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="HEB 13:2">Hib 13.2</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Aufia, <char style="w" lemma="Kelisone idele inolo">Kelisone idele inolo</char> kegeleda male adesenaga, amo gili sebu ogomo osolafia, sagoba homale.</para>
  <para style="li3" vid="ROM 12:13">Aufia, inolo sobele saabimo, uluba dimale. <figure style="fig" alt="Lady serving a meal" file="IB04119.TIF" size="col" copy="Farid Faadil © Biblica, Inc. Used with permission. All rights reserved worldwide." ref="12.13">Inolo sobele saabimo, uluba dimale.</figure><verse eid="ROM 12:13" /></para>
  <para style="li3">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 12:14" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12.14 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 5:44">Mad 5.44</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 4:12">1Kld 4.12</ref></char>
    </note>Aufia, inolo gada woba ofelefe amofeamo, <char style="w" lemma="Edililo - Ediliba Ofolo">ediliba ofa</char> molomale.</para>
  <para style="li3" vid="ROM 12:14">Efea ediliba ofelesia, efea kaoba sulu samabiyo.<verse eid="ROM 12:14" /></para>
  <para style="li3">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 12:15" />Henebasu labe amodai, ua henebasu melale.</para>
  <para style="li3" vid="ROM 12:15">Yegilibasu labe amodai, ua yegilibasu melale.<verse eid="ROM 12:15" /></para>
  <para style="li3">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 12:16" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12.16 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PRO 3:7">Snd 3.7</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Gine gelebamo hilise ule ufiasu kakainafia melale.</para>
  <para style="li3" vid="ROM 12:16">Aufia, gine meleba kaiisia, ana melabiyo.</para>
  <para style="li3" vid="ROM 12:16">Ge wi koleba buleba hilisesiale, inolo wida male anogodai ua muuba kalifia melale.</para>
  <para style="li3" vid="ROM 12:16">Aufia, elelimabiyo.<verse eid="ROM 12:16" /></para>
  <para style="li3">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 12:17" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12.17 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1TH 5:15">1Des 5.15</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Ilihe gilifea wolu molosenaga, amo ilifea wolu sabe obegeba molomabiyo.</para>
  <para style="li3" vid="ROM 12:17">Idele inolo suniane hame dobu ogo baafia, ilifea mana yogolelusu moloba walemale.<verse eid="ROM 12:17" /></para>
  <para style="li3">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 12:18" />Gilifealomo gilihe, idele inolo suniadai aeaba mesale.</para>
  <para style="li3" vid="ROM 12:18">Ilifealomo, ili auba misiyo habosenaga, amo hama. Gilihe ilidai aeaba mesale.<verse eid="ROM 12:18" /></para>
  <para style="li3">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 12:19" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12.19 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 32:35">Lo 32.35</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 5:39">Mad 5.39</ref></char>
    </note>Ne yagusodali, ulenohe wolu gilifea molosenaga, gine waagi sabe mesia isomabiyo.</para>
  <para style="li3" vid="ROM 12:19">Aubale. Godene Bugo eweguba selelu dobu. <char style="qt">“Isoyo mana amo Negulu, Nene Na sabeyo,”</char> Saminilo auba solumone, Godehe Ene gadilo alefasia, wolu gafea mololu amone sabe memesi, gili koleba Efea waagi gadefamale.<verse eid="ROM 12:19" /></para>
  <para style="li3">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 12:20" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12.20 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PRO 25:21-22">Snd 25.21-22</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 5:44">Mad 5.44</ref></char>
    </note>Aufia, gili koleba eweguba molomale.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="ROM 12:20" />
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 12:20">
    <char style="qt">Ge gisa mamiasenaga, amo efea naiyo waagi memale.</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 12:20">
    <char style="qt">E hano nabaisenaga, amo efea hano waagi memale.</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 12:20">
    <char style="qt">Ga auba molofe amohe, e heleba mololumo ene fadaba bisigia, yuaeyobafe.</char><verse eid="ROM 12:20" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="li3">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 12:21" />Mana woluhe ga waselesia dufa dafogolosi, fogo memabiyo.</para>
  <para style="li3" vid="ROM 12:21">Aubale. Ga koleba, mana nafulu molofemo alefasia, mana wolu amo waselesia, dufa dafogosia, kaamo melale.<verse eid="ROM 12:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="ROM 13" />
  <para style="s">Gamane yasiba labe amone sisa melale</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 13:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13.1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="TIT 3:1">Dai 3.1</ref>; <ref loc="PRO 8:15">Snd 8.15</ref></char>
    </note>Gamane yasifia labe amone sisa adesia, gili ine sulu dobolaba melale. Godehe ili amo iminifasia, dabalu amone ilifea molomesi gadefalu. Kiwigagalu inolofea labemo, Gode E-su moloba ufulu labe. <verse eid="ROM 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 13:2" />Aulugulu, inolo abehe gamane inolodai elelisia, e seale Godehe iminifia gadefalu inolo amodai elelife. Idele inolo auba molofe ili amo, elebe wolu diyobafe. <verse eid="ROM 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 13:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13.3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1PE 2:13-14">1Fid 2.13-14</ref></char></note>Idele inolo mana nafulusu moloba labemo, ili amo gamane inolo baaba sagiliyobafale. Woluda moloba labe ili amosumo sagiliyobafe. Ga gamane inolo baaba sagilibale miliyo hamesenaga, amo ga mana nafulusu moloba melale. Auba molosimo, ilihe gafea heneyobafe. <verse eid="ROM 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 13:4" />Ga helegeba mesesimo, Godehe ilifea dabalu amo molomesine gadefalu. Auluso, ga mana wolu molosenaga, amo ga sagilimale. Maumo, gamane inolo ilihe ibolo sebumo, balu sebuale. Aulugulu, ilihe ga dibolo dafogoyomone kiwigagalumo sebu. Godehe ilifea dabalu amone molomesi gadefalu alebaibu. Aulugulu, idele inolo wolu moloba labe amone, elebe sabe memesi ili amo gadefalu alebaibu. <verse eid="ROM 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 13:5" />Aulune, gili koleba gamane inolo sisa ligia, ili sulu selefemo kuliba daaba melale. Auba kuliba aasenaga, ilihe gafea naga meyobafale. Aufia, ge <char style="w">asigi nafulune si</char> amoda, gafea isoba molofeba saeyobafe. <figure style="fig" alt="Caesar in Rome" file="44_Ac_25_02_RG.jpg" size="col" copy="Sweet publishing" ref="13.1-7">Sisa e Lomene yasilo bule.</figure><verse eid="ROM 13:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 13:6" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13.6 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 22:21">Mad 22.21</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Mau ewe alefasia, gilihe dagese amo ofolo. Godehe gamanefea dabalu amo molomesi gadefalu alebaibune, ilihe hilia sunia dabalu amo moloba labe. <verse eid="ROM 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 13:7" />Gahe ulenofea kegele mesia duguba obegeyo dobunaga, meba obegemale.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="ROM 13:7" />
  <para style="li1" vid="ROM 13:7">Gamanefea dagese mesia duguba obegeyo dobunaga,</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="ROM 13:7">amo ilifea dagese memale.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="ROM 13:7">Ulenofea wi wabialeba saeyo dobunaga,</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="ROM 13:7">amo wabialeba saamale.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="ROM 13:7">Ulenofea hamedofa miliyo dobunaga,</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="ROM 13:7">amo hamedofa melale.<verse eid="ROM 13:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">No anogodai hameseyomo mana olaibo koleba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 13:8" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13.8 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 22:39-40">Mad 22.39-40</ref>; <ref loc="JAS 2:8">Yem 2.8</ref></char>
    </note>Kegele fealomo, uleno gafea dano melu amo, ga koleba duguba mebale melabiyo. Aubale. Auluso, hameselo mana fealosumo, eno auba kaasiale, no anogofea duguba mebasu melale. Enebamo, abehe no anogodai hamesesenaga, <char style="w">muguli</char> saaba ufulumo sunia kuliba abia ililiba ofelesia samodoyobafe. <verse eid="ROM 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 13:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13.9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 20:13-15">Kis 20.13-15</ref>, <ref loc="EXO 20:17">17</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:17-19">Lo 5.17-19</ref>, <ref loc="DEU 5:21">21</ref></char></note>Muguli saaba ufulumo selesia, <char style="qt">“Susugu mana molomabiyo. Inolo dufa olamabiyo. Fa dimabiyo. None kegele mesegemabiyo.”</char> Muguli noolo dobu amoda, sunia amone modomo, molomalelu sulu ewe dobu. <char style="qt">“Ga gene meleba hamesebuguba, nooloda aubasu hamesemale.”</char> <verse eid="ROM 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 13:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13.10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 13:4-7">1Kld 13.4-7</ref></char></note>Hameselo mana amo alefasia, inolo no anogo woba ofolale. Aulune, abehe hameselo mana kuliba aafe amohe, muguli mana sunia kuliba abia, ililiba ofelesia samodobu.<verse eid="ROM 13:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kelisone hilia hagoalefe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 13:11" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13.11 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EPH 5:14">Efe 5.14</ref>; <ref loc="1TH 5:6-7">1Des 5.6-7</ref></char>
    </note>Nahe gilifea auba molomesi selesumo ewe. Fogo aga ninida lolu ewe, gili fadaba asigibu. Godehe nini <char style="w" lemma="Gasiba dafelagoba dilo">gasiba dafelagoba</char> diyo hilia amo, hagoale adefegulu, gili hanelu dobu ogone degeyomo, halosi aga ewe. Nini maugaba hili <char style="w" lemma="Asigi ule ufulu">asigi ule ofelesimo</char>, hilia amo aso hago aloluso, aga amisumo hagoale koleba adefe. <verse eid="ROM 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 13:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13.12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1JN 2:8">1Yon 2.8</ref></char></note>Nigili ama eloyo hagoalesia, hiliaeyomo hagoalefe. Aulugulu, ninihe nigiligagalune mana amo sunia huba dafalisia, aufia yaida yoboyone fagulomo kakamale. <verse eid="ROM 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 13:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13.13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 21:34">Lug 21.34</ref>; <ref loc="EPH 5:18">Efe 5.18</ref></char></note>Ninihe yaida molologuba, mana isolu koleba amone kuliba maiyoba. Aufia, nini elelifia, sigilo hulagaloda, kagoalo manada, susugu mololo manada, egedidiba sodo manada, belagusia babiyo habolo manada, mana amogulumo molomabiyo.<verse eid="ROM 13:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 13:14" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13.14 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EPH 5:11">Efe 5.11</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Mana amogulumo huba dafalisia, gili koleba <char style="w">Saminilo</char> Yesu <char style="w" lemma="Keliso">Kelisomo</char> difasia, fagulo kaaloguba kaamale. Aufia, gili koleba <char style="w">helefealune huu</char> amone molobaiyesia mesegelo mana, amo aso kuliba maiyo daabale ligia, ami maiyaleba asigiba melale.<verse eid="ROM 13:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="ROM 14" />
  <para style="s">Ninihe damene none mana osolamabiyo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 14:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">14.1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ROM 15:7">Lom 15.7</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Lome sese gilimo, gili aleba ami sulu nenesiamo, sulu mau noolomo nafuluba ua eeba selesiale ado. Noolo eesia, noolo eesiale sodo. Sulu mau amo alefasia, noolo anogo osolaba dafalimabiyo. Aubale. <char style="w">Asigi ule ufulu</char> kiwidale damene eda waagi melesi, fogo meba melale.<verse eid="ROM 14:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 14:2" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">14.2 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 9:3-4">Stt 9.3-4</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Na selesu ewe, ewene selesu. <char style="w">Asigi ule ufulu</char> kiwida damene ilihe eweguba hiliselo. “Sigidubulu idele inolohe kegele waagi nalabia siba adesenaga, mana amo wolualeba” asigibu. Auluso, damene noolone asigi ule ufulumo kiwigaalu amoguluale adefe. Ili asigisia, “Sigidubulu idele inolo ilihe kelebulu huu amogulu naasenaga, amo ili mana wolu molofebuba” sodo. Aulugulu, ili huu sunia nolale. Gili gagaiyosiamo, mana amone asigifiamo, uleno baea gadefamabiyo. Aubale. Kegele amone woluba, me wolualeba kowesia, gine geleba hegeba sulu samabiyo. <verse eid="ROM 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 14:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14.3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 2:16">Kol 2.16</ref></char></note>Aufia, kegele suniada nalabia silo inolo amo gilimo, gilihe inolo kelebulu huuda nolale amofea, baaba ilogosia, wasolu loluba samabiyo. Aufia, kelebulu huuda nolale inolo gilimo, kelebulu huuda nolo amofea gilihe ilifea wolu mololusia, sesia, osolaba dafalimabiyo. Enebamo, Gode Ehe inolo ili amoda uluba dulu alebaibu. <verse eid="ROM 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 14:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14.4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 7:1">Mad 7.1</ref>; <ref loc="JAS 4:11-12">Yem 4.11-12</ref></char></note>Gahe none dabalu mololo faibe amo osolasia, efea wolu mololusia, sefia osolaba dafalifemo, amo ga abesia ause? Yasilo ene alefasia, ene dabalu mololo faibe amo nafulubada, wolubada, ene koleba osolaeyobafe. Dabalu mololo faibe e kiwigaafia kalugasenagada, gelebaifia adesenagada, amo ene yasilone kegele koleba dobu. Amo gineale. Auluso, <char style="w" lemma="Saminilo">Saminilone</char> dabalu mololo faibe e-mo, kiwigaafia kalugaeyobafe. Enebamo, Saminilo Ehe e kiwigaafia kalugaaba melesi, moloba ufiyodolu labe koleba.<verse eid="ROM 14:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 14:5" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">14.5 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GAL 4:10-11">Gal 4.10-11</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Gili aleba ugi, sigidubulu idele inolo noolohe hilisesia, hilia noolomo iminiba ufulu hilia bule kolebaba hiliselo. Auluso, inolo noolo hilisesia, hilia amo sunia ule aiba hamagulu dobuba asigilo. Gilihe hilia amone, eweguba, me amoguba, hiliseba yaafe amo, amo waagima. Gine asigi koleba hilisefeguba, kuliba daaba melale. <verse eid="ROM 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 14:6" />Maumo, inolo uleno asigisia, hilia ewe noekeneba asigisenaga, amo ehe Saminilo asigisia aufe. Inolo uleno kelebulu huu nabiamo, inolo amohe Saminilofea henesuba safasia naasenaga, amo e Saminilo asigifia naafe. Aufia, inolo kelebulu huu nolalemo, ehe Saminilo asigisia, huu amo aiyafe. Aufia, eda, huu nabale, auba aiyaba ligia, Godefea henelu sulu sodo.<verse eid="ROM 14:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7-8" style="v" sid="ROM 14:7-8" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">14.7-8 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GAL 2:20">Gal 2.20</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Nini helefealu iwi aso bebea sigiamo, nini bebea alebaibu ewene maumo, nineale. Aufia, nini olasimo, nini olafe amone maumo, nineale. Enebamo, nini bebea sigiamo, amo nini Saminilo Ene koleba ligia, bebea alebaibu. Aufia, nini olasiamo, amo nini Saminilo Ene koleba ligia, olasu. Aulugulu, nini bebea solunagada, me olasenagada, amo nini Saminilo Ene koleba alebaibu. <verse eid="ROM 14:7-8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 14:9" />Mau amone koleba alefasia, <char style="w">Keliso</char> olafia haiba bebea misiyone degelu. Amo alefasia, idele inolo bebea kakainabu amone Saminiloda, aufia idele inolo danelu amone Saminiloda, E amo miliyofia aulu.<verse eid="ROM 14:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 14:10" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">14.10 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2CO 5:10">2Kld 5.10</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Aulune, gili gine damenedali noolo anogone mana osolasia molobebelemabiyo. Aufia, gine damenedali noolo anogofea baaba ilogoba bamabiyo. Nini sunia Gode Ene osolafea olea ami kalugaeyobafebamo, gili asigifalela? <verse eid="ROM 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 14:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14.11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 45:23">Ais 45.23</ref>; <ref loc="PHP 2:10-11">Fil 2.10-11</ref></char></note>Godene bugo eweguba selelu dobu.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="ROM 14:11" />
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 14:11">
    <char style="qt">“Na Saminilo, Na miliyolu miliyo lolugulu, Ne sulu, na selesu ewemo, seale koleba.</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 14:11">
    <char style="qt">Idele inolo sunia, Na sisa emo hugulumo sagaba misiyobafe.</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 14:11">
    <char style="qt">Ili sunia mofeyo selesia, ‘Ga Gode bule koleba labeba’ ulufaba saaba dafelagoyobafe.”</char><verse eid="ROM 14:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 14:12" />Aulune, nini sunia Ene olegia ami kalugaafia, Godehe nine miliyolumo osolaba bamesi, nini elebi elebibahe amo Efea mefia miliyo dobu.<verse eid="ROM 14:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ge damene no anogo kani wadosi, ga i misu naliba homabiyo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 14:13" />Aulugulu, ninihe nine damene no anogodali ine mana osolaeyomo hamale koleba. Auluso, gili koleba gine asigi osolasia, gilihe gine damene no anogo emo sauwasia gelebailosi, abane diba homabiyo. Aufia, e kani wadosi, i misu naliba homabiyo. <verse eid="ROM 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 14:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14.14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 10:15">HD 10.15</ref>; <ref loc="TIT 1:15">Dai 1.15</ref></char></note>Na Saminilo Yesudai kulifia lolu ewe, na eweguba fadaba asigibu. Godene si saabia, naiyo kegele uleno aiyaloda male koleba. Auluso, inolo uleno hilisesia, naiyo kegele uleno aiyafebuba hilisesenaga, amo efea koleba, naiyo kegele amo aiyafe. <verse eid="ROM 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 14:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14.15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 8:11-13">1Kld 8.11-13</ref></char></note>Naiyo ga naafe amohe, ge damene no anogo keleba asigimesi molosenaga, amo ga koleba molofe amomo, hameselo mana kuliba abia molofale. Ga naafe amohe, ge damene none asigi ule ufulu woba dafolosi, eweguba asigima. Keliso E olasiamo, Ehe ge damenedali ili amo gasiba dafelagoba diyone olalu.<verse eid="ROM 14:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 14:16" />Kegele nafulu dobu amofea alefasia, ili noolohe woba dafa sodosi, gili fogo memabiyo. <verse eid="ROM 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 14:17" />Enebamo, Godehe Yasifia Luba Ligia Saminilo Ada amone eloba bamesine, manamo hala? Naiyodai, hanodai, nolo me nolale mana amone eloba babiyola? Aa, amoale koleba. Aubale. Mana ewegulu. <char style="w">Asubane Noekene</char> alefasia, isolu ado manada, <char style="w" lemma="Aealo - Aeaba Ofolo">aeaba</char> esebalo ado manada, henelo manada, amone eloba babiyobafe. Inolo uleno mana amogulu dobia ami goasenaga, amo ehe mana amo bisigia, Godehe ami yasifia luba labebuba eloba babiyobafe. <verse eid="ROM 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 14:18" />Maumo, uleno abehe mana ewe kuliba abia, Kelisone dabalu molosiamo, amo Godehe efea heneyobafe. Ausi, inolo noolohe e nafulu molofebusia, efea heneyobafe.<verse eid="ROM 14:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 14:19" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">14.19 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ROM 12:18">Lom 12.18</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 15:2">15.2</ref></char>
    </note>Aulugulu, aealo mana nini aleba melesine, nini koleba migagaba maiyone dabalu kiwigaaba molomale. Auba ausia, nine geleba kiwigaaba ofolaba ligia, migagaba daaba melale. <verse eid="ROM 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 14:20" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14.20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 8:13">1Kld 8.13</ref></char></note>Auluso, gilihe naiyo nolo mana amo alefasia, Godene dabalu amo woba homabiyo. Seale koleba, naiyo suniamo, nafulu, aiyalale dobu. Auluso, gahe naiyo naafe amo alefasia, inolo no gelebaiba ofelesenaga, amo ga mana wolu molofe. <verse eid="ROM 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 14:21" />Gahe kelebulu huu naasida, me <char style="w">waini</char> hano naasida, me gahe kegele amene no molosida, ge damene nohe ga molofe amo bafasia, gelebaiyo weiyaasenaga, amo ga mana auba koleba molomabiyo.<verse eid="ROM 14:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 14:22" />Gahe kegele amone hilisesia, auba amene hilisefe, amo noneale. Aubale. Amo genedai, Godedai, dobu hamaga. Inolo asigisia, kegele uleno nafulububa hilisefia, e amo molosi, ene asigi nafulune sihe kegele amo alefasia e godosalenaga, amo e heneyo dobu. <verse eid="ROM 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 14:23" />Auluso, inolo abehe asigi dabagalafia ligia, naasenaga, amo naiyo naafe amohe, ene meleba godofe. Mau ene? E naiyo naafe amo, <char style="w">asigi ule ufulu</char> enofia naafale. Aubamo, kegele sunia asigi ule ufulufeafia saabale amomo, <char style="w" lemma="Wolu / Wolu mololo">wolu</char> dobu.<verse eid="ROM 14:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="ROM 15" />
  <para style="s">Nini koleba noolo anogo heneba ofelesia moloyoba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 15:1" />Asigi ule ufulu kiwidale labe ilihe, moloyodoluale adesimo, asigi ule ufulu kiwida labe ninihe, nine melebasu heneba ufiyone asigifia, beega daaba melabiyo. Aubale. Ninihe ine koleluale ado mana amone agigifia daaba melale. <verse eid="ROM 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 15:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15.2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 10:24">1Kld 10.24</ref>, <ref loc="1CO 10:33">33</ref></char></note>Nine damenedali noolo ili nafulu melesi, nini elebi elebibahe ili heneba heafuba ufiyo dobu. Ausi, ine asigi ule ufulumo kiwigaaba sobolabia felaeyobafe. <verse eid="ROM 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 15:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15.3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 69:9">Sng 69.9</ref></char></note>Maumo, <char style="w">Keliso</char> E-da Ene meleba heneba ufuluale. Nini amo asigibu. Maumo, Godene bugo usu selelu dobu ule difasia, Yesuhe Godefea eweguba solu. <char style="qt">“Ilihe Gafea soaneba selaba adefe ogo, soaneba sulu amo, aga ilihe Nafea baaba ofelefe.”</char> <verse eid="ROM 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 15:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15.4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2TI 3:16">2Dim 3.16</ref></char></note>Gili ewe asigima. Sulu sunia samini Godene bugo seleba ufulu amo, ninifea waleyone seleba ufulu. Sulu ewehe nini kiwi sanefia afolosine, nine asigi degeba ofa walefe. Ausia, Godehe ninifea meyobafe amone, ninihe <char style="w" lemma="Hame diba ofogosia yasiyo">hame diba ofogofia yasiba</char> lolu.<verse eid="ROM 15:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 15:5" />Nini kiwi sanefia afolosine, Godehe nine asigida degeba ofolo amo, Ehe gilifea eweguba molomesi, na Efea haaliba lolu. Yesu Keliso E asigilu hamaguba, gilida gine gelebafea aubasu asigimesi, na Efea haaliba lolu. <verse eid="ROM 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 15:6" />Gili auba asigifia ligiamo, gili sunia hilise ule, mofeyo ule adesia, Godene wi digiyobafe. Gode, nine <char style="w">Saminilo</char> Yesu Kelisone Enao amo, E.<verse eid="ROM 15:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yudadai, yau mosomudai, aalifaba Godene wi digife</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 15:7" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">15.7 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ROM 14:1">Lom 14.1</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Yesu Keliso Ehe gili waagi afelesiale, uluba dulu amoguba, gilida gine miliyolu usu gine geleba aubasu uluba dimale. Gine geleba auba uluba disiamo, gilihe Godene wi digiba saeyobafe. <verse eid="ROM 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 15:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15.8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 15:24">Mad 15.24</ref></char></note>Doma, nahe gilifea eweguba selesu. Yesu Keliso E-mo, Yuda mosomu sagoba ufiyone, ine balu dabalu mololo adesia holobagalu. Ausiamo, Godehe samini saaba ufulumo, E moloba yaaluba walefe. Enebamo, Yesu dabalu molosimo, Godehe Yudane enauwadalifea saaba ufulu amo, seale moloba yaalu. <verse eid="ROM 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 15:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15.9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 3:25">HD 3.25</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 18:49">Sng 18.49</ref></char></note>Aubasumo, <char style="w" lemma="Yau idele inolo - Yau mosomu">yau idele inolohe</char> Godene <char style="w">kanululo</char> mana amone henesia, Ene wi digiba selaba melesi gadefalu. Godene bugo amone iminisia, eweguba selelu dobu.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="ROM 15:9" />
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 15:9">“<char style="qt">Aulugulu, na yau idele inolo aleba ligia, nahe Ga wabialeba saeyobasu.</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 15:9">
    <char style="qt">Ge wi digisia, na gasa selaba miliyobasu.”</char><verse eid="ROM 15:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 15:10" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">15.10 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 32:43">Lo 32.43</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Godene bugo seleiya fogo no amida, eweguba selelu dobu.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="ROM 15:10" />
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 15:10">
    <char style="qt">“Yau idele inolo gilimo, Godene idele inolo galiba ligia, heafusia henema.”</char><verse eid="ROM 15:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 15:11" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">15.11 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 117:1">Sng 117.1</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Aufia sulu noda, eweguba selelu dobu.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="ROM 15:11" />
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 15:11">
    <char style="qt">“Yau idele inolo gilimo, Saminilone wi digisia henema.</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 15:11">
    <char style="qt">Aufia, helefealu idele inolo sunia gilihe, Efea gasa selaba mela.”</char><verse eid="ROM 15:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 15:12" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">15.12 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 11:10">Ais 11.10</ref>; <ref loc="REV 5:5">MUU 5.5</ref></char>
    </note>Aufia saabia, <char style="w" lemma="Aisaia">Aisaia</char> selesia,</para>
  <para style="b" vid="ROM 15:12" />
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 15:12">
    <char style="qt">“<char style="w" lemma="Yesi">Yesine</char> semefea alefasia, baii fisaba holobagaeyobafe.</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 15:12">
    <char style="qt">Amo fisaba holobagafasiamo, Ehe helefealu idele inolo sunia yasiyobafe.</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 15:12">
    <char style="qt">Yau idele inolo ilihe ine <char style="w" lemma="Hame diba ofogosia yasiyo">hame Efea diba ofelagofia yasiba</char> miliyobafe.”</char><verse eid="ROM 15:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 15:13" />Godehe nine <char style="w" lemma="Hame diba ofogosia yasiyo">hame diba ofogofia yasiba</char> melesi moloba ofolo. Na Edai sulu selesiamo, na gili hilisesia, eweguba selesu. Gilihe Efea <char style="w" lemma="Asigi ule ufulu">asigi ule ofelesi</char>, Ehe heneloda, <char style="w" lemma="Aealo - Aeaba Ofolo">aealoda</char>, gine libo usu wasigaaba homesi, na Efea selesu. Ausimo, <char style="w" lemma="Asubane Noekene">Asubane Noekenene</char> kiwigagalu amo alefasia, gilihe Gode nafulu moloyobafeba hame diba ofogofia yasiba labe. Aulune, gine libo usu wasigafia galebaisaeyobafe.<verse eid="ROM 15:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Folo e yau idele inolone dabalu mololo labe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 15:14" />Ne damenedali, gili nafulusu wasigafia adogulu, gilihe asigida dulu alebaibu. Aulune, gili gine geleba isoba waleyodolu labe. Amonemo na fadaba asigibu. <verse eid="ROM 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 15:15" />Auluso, sulu noolo nahe gilifea seleba mesu ewemo, kolelu seleba mesu. Gili sulu selelu amone haiba asigiba obegemesi, na gilifea seleba mesu. Na auba seleba mesiamo, gigilifia ligia selesuale. Maumo, Gode E na kanuluba ofelesia, Ehe na dabalu ewene molomesi meso. <verse eid="ROM 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 15:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15.16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 1:5">Lom 1.5</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 11:13">11.13</ref></char></note>Ehe na Yesu Keliso Ene dabalu mololo inolo melesi gadefaso. Aulugulu, <char style="w" lemma="Yau idele inolo - Yau mosomu">yau idele inolo</char> ili aleba dabalu molomesi, Ehe na hilibaiso. Aufia, Ene awalu sulu nafulu walemesi, Ehe na ami gadefaso. Aulugulu, na-mo ulu soba melone dabalu molologulu adesia, nahe yau idele inolo ili amo, Efea ulu soba melo kegele amogulu memesi, Ehe na iminiso. Aufia, <char style="w">Asubane Noekene</char> amohe ilimo <char style="w" lemma="Godedai muuba kalilu melesi moloba ofolo">muuba kalilu melesi, ili noekene moloba waaleyobafe</char>. Ili auba muuba kalilu moloba ufulu labi, Godehe ulu melu ili amo heneba diyobafe.<verse eid="ROM 15:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 15:17" />Aulune, na Keliso Yesudai kulifia ligiamo, Gode Ene dabalu amone moloba lolugulu, na bule koleba kaiisu. <verse eid="ROM 15:17" /><verse number="18-19" style="v" sid="ROM 15:18-19" />Nahe sulu noolo saeyaleso, Keliso Ehe nafeafia moloba yaalu amonesu, ulufaba waleyobasu. Na mana mololumo alefasiada, na sulu solumo alefasiada, <char style="w" lemma="Momolelu kegele">eloba bamesine momolelu kegele</char> moloba yaalumo alefasiada, yau idele inolo Godene sulu dofasia, kuliba maiyone eno amo aiba, nahe ili uluba dibia milibailu. Godene Asubanene kiwigagalu amo alefasia, nahe ili auba uluba dibia dedalelu. Amosu na selesu. Aulugulu, nahe Yelusalame amifia, awalu sulu nafulu maugafia walelabia abia, hele Ililikumufealo amolomo, Kelisone awalu sulu nafulu waleba samodolu. <verse eid="ROM 15:18-19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 15:20" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15.20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CO 10:15-16">2Kld 10.15-16</ref></char></note>Na moloyo asigilu bulemo ewe. Idele inolo Keliso aso asigiluale kakainabia amimo, na awalu sulu nafulu waleyo asigife. Auba molosimo, nahe ikau nohe gaaba ufulu saabia ami molo diyale. <verse eid="ROM 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 15:21" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15.21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 52:15">Ais 52.15</ref></char></note>Aubale. Godene bugo eweguba selelu dobumone na kuliba maiyo hilisefe.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="ROM 15:21" />
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 15:21">
    <char style="qt">“Idele inolo ilifea Gode saaba soluale amo ilihe, E babiyobafe.</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 15:21">
    <char style="qt">Aufia, idele inolo E saaba selesi dubuluale amo ilihe, fadaba asigiba diyobafe.”</char><verse eid="ROM 15:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Folo e Lome maiyone daiyalu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 15:22" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">15.22 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ROM 1:13">Lom 1.13</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Na dabalu moloyo wedinale dobu ewehe, gili labea miyomo kaafe. <verse eid="ROM 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 15:23" />Auluso agamo, hele ewelomo dabalu na saabia no moloyomo malebu. Aufia, hamu wedinale aleba amimo, na gine misi babaiyeba asigiba alolu. <verse eid="ROM 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 15:24" />Aulugulu, na hele bule Sefeini maiyomo asigifia, madeneba ligia, ami abiamo, gili labea goalabia maiyone daiyaba lolu. Aufia, na gili labea goasia, fogo wedino gilidai heneba alefasia, gilihe na Sefeini ami malesimo, sagoba homesi hamefe. <verse eid="ROM 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 15:25" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15.25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 16:1-4">1Kld 16.1-4</ref></char></note>Auluso, amo aso. Aga na Yelusalame amidale maiyone daaba lolu. <char style="w" lemma="Godedai muuba kalilu idele inolo">Godene idele inolo</char> ami alebaibu amo sagoba ufiyone aasu. <verse eid="ROM 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 15:26" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15.26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 16:1">1Kld 16.1</ref>; <ref loc="2CO 8:1">2Kld 8.1</ref>; <ref loc="2CO 9:2">9.2</ref>, <ref loc="2CO 9:12">12</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 24:17">HD 24.17</ref></char></note>Maumo, asigi ule ufulu idele inolo hele <char style="w" lemma="Masedonia">Masedoniada</char>, <char style="w" lemma="Akaea">Akaeada</char>, iwi kakainabu amohe, weagulu idele inolo Yelusalame kakainabu amone sagoba ufiyone, mole noolo gagaiyoso. <verse eid="ROM 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 15:27" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15.27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 9:11">1Kld 9.11</ref></char></note>Ilihe mole mesiamo, heneba ligia, ine hamefeguba meso. Ili auba melu amo, nafulu koleba. Enebamo, <char style="w" lemma="Yau idele inolo - Yau mosomu">yau mosomuhe</char>, Yuda mosomudai dano ufulugulu alebaibu. Maumo, yau idele inolo ilihe, Yuda mosomune asubanefealone edililo beleme osolaba dulubiyo. Aulugulu, ilihe ine helefealune edililo kegele amo osolafia, Yuda idele inolofea duguba meyone dobu. <verse eid="ROM 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 15:28" />Aulugulu, na Yelusalame ami goafia, mole gagaiyolu amo ilifea meba yaafia, ili sunia diba samodosi, na ami afasia, Sefeini ami abia, gili babiyo. <verse eid="ROM 15:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 15:29" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15.29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 1:11">Lom 1.11</ref></char></note>Na hilisefe, na gili labea inigiamo, Kelisone <char style="w" lemma="Edililo - Ediliba Ofolo">edililo</char> wedinale wasigafia, gili labea dia miyobasuba asigife.<verse eid="ROM 15:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 15:30" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">15.30 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2CO 1:11">2Kld 1.11</ref>; <ref loc="COL 4:3">Kol 4.3</ref>; <ref loc="2TH 3:1">2Des 3.1</ref></char>
    </note>Ne damenedali, na gilifea kiwigaaba selesia, nine Saminilo Yesu Keliso alefasiada, Asubane Ene hameselo alefasiada, gilihe nadai ua yobolo adesia, na hilisesia, <char style="w" lemma="Godedai sulu selefe">Godedai sulu saamale</char>. <verse eid="ROM 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 15:31" />Yudia idele inolo Godene suluda saidafelefe, ili amohe na woba ofolosi, gilihe Godedai sulu selaba melale. Aufia, mole na Yelusalame dibia maiyobafemo, nahe Godene <char style="w">muuba kalilu</char> idele inolo ami kakainabu ili amofea mesimo, ili henesia, amo heafuba dimesi, gili amone Godedai sulu selaba melale. <verse eid="ROM 15:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ROM 15:32" />Gili auba Godedai sulu selaba melaleba selesu maumo, Yelusalame ili mole diba samodosi, fogo ami, Godehe na gili labea henefia milesine eno sogoba ufiyobafe. Amo Godene hamenaga, aufia na gilidai ua aselesia, ninifaba hisu diba misiyo.<verse eid="ROM 15:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ROM 15:33" />
    <char style="w" lemma="Aealo - Aeaba Ofolo">Aeaba</char> mesesi melo Gode amo E, gili suniadai miliyobafe. <char style="sls"><char style="w">Amen</char>.</char> Seale koleba auba auyobafe.<verse eid="ROM 15:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="ROM 16" />
  <para style="s">Folohe idele inolo wedinalefea hawiyoba selefe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 16:1" />Nine nano Fibi ewe, gili labea goasi, gili koleba e heneba uluba dimale. E Senikilia dauno <char style="w">sese</char> amone digono ido uleno labeo. <verse eid="ROM 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 16:2" /><char style="w" lemma="Saminilo">Saminilone</char> wifea alefasia, na gilifea eweguba doba bosolu. Godene <char style="w" lemma="Godedai muuba kalilu idele inolo">muuba kalilu inolo</char> uleno saabi, uluba diloguba, gilihe ido eweda, aubasu uluba disia, sagoba homale. Enebamo, ido ewehe idele inolo wedinaleda sagoba ofelesia, nada sagoba ofolo. Aulugulu, ehe kegele amene hamefemo, gilihe efea memale.<verse eid="ROM 16:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 16:3" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">16.3 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 18:2">HD 18.2</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Nahe Fulisiladai, ene aino Akiwiladai, aalufea hawiyoba selesu. Aalu amohe Keliso Yesune dabalu moloba ligia, nadai ua dabalu mololo labeo. <verse eid="ROM 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 16:4" />Aaluhe na sagoba ofelesia, aine miliyolumo nafea weasesia, olaeyomo sagilisale. Amone, nahe aalufea heneba lolu. Na-suale. Aubale. <char style="w" lemma="Yau idele inolo - Yau mosomu">Yau mosomune</char> sese idele inolo ili suniada, aalufea henelu sulu sodo.<verse eid="ROM 16:4" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 16:5" />Aufia, sese aine moloa gagaiyofe gili amofeada hawiyoba selesu.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="ROM 16:5">Aufia, ne hameselu Efenesu efeada, na hawiyoba selesu. Hele bule Asia amimo, inolo <char style="w" lemma="Keliso">Kelisofea</char> maugaba asigi ule ufulu, amo e-biyo.<verse eid="ROM 16:5" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 16:6" />Aufia, <char style="w" lemma="Malia[[4]], nooloda alolu">Malia</char> efeada hawiyoba selesu. Ehe gili sagoba ufiyone, hogololu dabalu wedinale mololubiyo.<verse eid="ROM 16:6" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 16:7" />Aufia, Adolonikusudai, Yuniadai, aalufeada hawiyoba selesu. Aalu amo ne mosomu ule labeo. Aufia, aalumo, nadai dibolo moloa ua alolu. <char style="w" lemma="Hilibaisi daalu inolo">Hilibaisi daalu</char> dabalu mololo aleba ami, aalu wida labeo. Na aso Kelisodai kulibale labi, aaludale Edai kulifia alolubiyo.<verse eid="ROM 16:7" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 16:8" />Aufia, Abiladusu efeada hawiyoba selesu. Saminilofea alefasia, e-mo ne hameselu labeo.<verse eid="ROM 16:8" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 16:9" />Aufia, Ulubanusu efeada hawiyoba selesu. E nadai Kelisone dabalu ua mololo labeo.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="ROM 16:9">Aufia, ne hameselu Sedagisi efeada hawiyoba selesu.<verse eid="ROM 16:9" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 16:10" />Aufia, Abelese efeada hawiyoba selesu. Efea higinilu holobagaso. Auluso, e Keliso afelesiale, kiwida adesia, amo suniaso.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="ROM 16:10">Aufia, Alisidobulusu ene damenedali ilifeada, hawiyoba selesu.<verse eid="ROM 16:10" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 16:11" />Aufia, Helodiono efeada, hawiyoba selesu. E ne mosomu ule labeo.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="ROM 16:11">Aufia, Nasisone damenedali Saminilodai kulifia alebaibu ili amofeada, hawiyoba selesu.<verse eid="ROM 16:11" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 16:12" />Aufia, Dilifinadai, Dilifosadai, aalufeada, hawiyoba selesu. Ido aida amo Saminilone dabalu kiwigaaba moloba labeso.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="ROM 16:12">Aufia, ne hameselu Felesisi efeada, hawiyoba selesu. Saminilone dabalu kiwigaaba koleba moloba ado ido nomo, e-biyo.<verse eid="ROM 16:12" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 16:13" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">16.13 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MRK 15:21">Mag 15.21</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Aufia, Lufusu efeada, hawiyoba selesu. Saminilohe molobebelelu ulenomo, e-biyo.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="ROM 16:13">Aufia, ene enaefeada, hawiyoba selesu. Amo e, ne nae adoguba labeo.<verse eid="ROM 16:13" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 16:14" />Aufia, Asinakilidusu efeada, Felegono efeada, Hemese efeada, Fadolobasa efeada, Hemasa efeada, aufia, ne nelewodali, nanodali ilidai alebaibu ili amofea hawiyoba selesu.<verse eid="ROM 16:14" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 16:15" />Aufia, afelesia, Filogusu efeada, Yulia efeada, Neleusu efeada, ene enano efeada, Olimafasa efeada, aufia, Godene muuba kalilu idele inolo sunia ilidai ua gagaiyolo ili amofeada, hawiyoba selesu.<verse eid="ROM 16:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 16:16" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">16.16 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1CO 16:20">1Kld 16.20</ref>; <ref loc="1PE 5:14">1Fid 5.14</ref></char>
    </note>Gili gine geleba heneba wakalisiamo, muuba kaliba mimiba wakalimale.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="ROM 16:16" />
  <para style="m" vid="ROM 16:16">Kelisone sese ewelo kakainabu suniahe, gilifea hawiyoba sabaiso.<verse eid="ROM 16:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Inolo noolohe sese olabofe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 16:17" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">16.17 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 7:15">Mad 7.15</ref>; <ref loc="TIT 3:10">Dai 3.10</ref></char>
    </note>Ne damenedali, na gilifea sulu ewe kiwigaaba selesu. Sese osolaba dafiyone, i misuda naliba ofelefe inolo ili amo nafuluba bamale. Gilimo sulu seale koleba dulu labeso, inolo ili amohe sulu heleba walesia, idele inolo eno no heleba ulubia anosi, gili amodai gegoaba melabiyo. <verse eid="ROM 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 16:18" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16.18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PHP 3:19">Fil 3.19</ref>; <ref loc="2PE 2:3">2Fid 2.3</ref></char></note>Enebamo, ili ogohe nine Saminilo Kelisone dabalu mololale. Auluso, ilihe ine domalane hame molobaiyefe amone kuliba ano. Ili amohe sulu nenalebalu selesia, hahanoba ofelesia, inolo nafuluba enogele adefale, ine asigi sigiba dia ano. Aulugulu, gili nafuluba enogele melale.<verse eid="ROM 16:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 16:19" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">16.19 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ROM 1:8">Lom 1.8</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 14:20">1Kld 14.20</ref></char>
    </note>Gilihe Godene sulu nafuluba dofasia, kuliba aafeba solumo, nini sunia dubulu. Mau amohe na gilifea henesu. Aufia, na eweda hamefe. Gilihe mana nafulu moloyofealomo, dawaloba asigilu melale. Auluso, wolu moloyofealomo asigiluale ligia, babealu melale.<verse eid="ROM 16:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 16:20" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">16.20 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 3:15">Stt 3.15</ref>
      </char>
    </note>
    <char style="w" lemma="Aealo - Aeaba Ofolo">Aeaba</char> mesesi melo Gode, Ehe <char style="w" lemma="Sedene">Sedenene</char> kiwigagalumo emelasia, fasiba dafelesia, gine emo sisa ufiyomo, fogo hagoalefe.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ROM 16:20">Nine Saminilo Yesune <char style="w" lemma="Kanululo">kanululomo</char>, gilidai miliyobafe.<verse eid="ROM 16:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Inolo Folodai alolu ilihe Lome ilifea hawiyoba solu</para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 16:21" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">16.21 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 16:1-2">HD 16.1-2</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 19:22">19.22</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 20:4">20.4</ref></char>
    </note>
    <char style="w" lemma="Dimodi">Dimodi</char>, nadai dabalu ua mololo eda, gilifea hawiyoba seleso.</para>
  <para style="li" vid="ROM 16:21">Ausi, Lusiusuda, Yesonoda, Sosibadada, ilida gilifea hawiyoba seleso. Ili amo ne mosomu ule alebaibiyo.<verse eid="ROM 16:21" /></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 16:22" />Ausi, Delidiusu, nada Saminilodai kulifia ligia, gilifea hawiyoba selesu. Nahe Folone mofeo sulu selefemo dobelesia, sowi ewe seleba ofelesu. <figure style="fig" alt="I, Tertius, wrote down this letter" file="C001.JPG" size="col" ref="16.22">Delidiusuhe sowi ewe seleba ofelefe.</figure><verse eid="ROM 16:22" /></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="23-24" style="v" sid="ROM 16:23-24" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">16.23-24 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 19:22">HD 19.22</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 1:14">1Kld 1.14</ref></char>
    </note>Ausi, Gaiyusu eda, gilifea hawiyoba seleso. Ehe na ene moloa heafuba uluba labeo. Ene moloa iwi, <char style="w">sese</char> idele inolo sunia gagaiyoba ado.</para>
  <para style="li" vid="ROM 16:23-24">Elosia, Elasadusu eda, gilifea hawiyoba selefe. E-mo, sidi ewene gamanene mole yasilo labeo.</para>
  <para style="li" vid="ROM 16:23-24">Aufia, nine nelewo Kawadiusu eda, gilifea hawiyoba seleso.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16.23-24 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Baibolo noolo iwi gegoaba eweguba selefe. Nine Saminilo Yesu Kelisone kanululo gilidai miliyobafe. <char style="sls">Amen.</char> Seale koleba auba auyobafe. </char></note><verse eid="ROM 16:23-24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Folohe Saminilofea wabialelu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 16:25" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">16.25 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EPH 1:9">Efe 1.9</ref>; <ref loc="EPH 3:5">3.5</ref>, <ref loc="EPH 3:9">9</ref>; <ref loc="COL 1:26">Kol 1.26</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 1:5">Lom 1.5</ref></char>
    </note>Ninihe Godene wimo wabialeba saeyoba. Enebamo, Ehe gili kiwigaaba kalugaamesi, moloyodolu labe. Ausi, gilihe awalu sulu nafulu na waleba ado amo sefia ligia, gili kalugaeyobafe. Yesu Keliso ulufaba holobagaluba solu amone, Awalu sulu nafulu amo ewe. Samini adabia mulufealomo, sulu amo mugusilu ufulu. <verse eid="ROM 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 16:26" />Auluso, maugaluda male, samodoyoda male, alefalu Gode Ehe, aga mugusilu amo ulufaba homaba solu. Idele inolohe Gode auba moloyobafeba asigimesine, <char style="w">saaba ofolo</char> inolo ilihe, saaba ofolabia selelabia mulu. Mugusilu amone elemo, ewe. Samini waagifia Godehe daiyasia, yau idele inolo mosomu sunia ilida <char style="w" lemma="Asigi ule ufulu">asigi ule homesi</char> daiyalu. Ili asigi ule ofasia, E sisa adesia, Ene sulu dobelesia, kuliba milibaimesifia aulu. Amomo aga ulufaba dobu.<verse eid="ROM 16:26" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="qc">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 16:27" />Yesu Kelisofeafia,</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="ROM 16:27">Godene wi digiyoba.</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="ROM 16:27">Ule E-su dawalolo dulu labe.</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="ROM 16:27">Elalelumo,</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="ROM 16:27">Efea alefalu alefaeyobafe.</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="ROM 16:27">
    <char style="sls">
      <char style="w">Amen</char>.</char> Amo seale koleba.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ROM 16:27">
    <figure style="fig" alt="End of book bilas" file="EndOfBookOnobasulu_Epistles.tiff" size="span" loc="End of Book" ref="16.27" /><verse eid="ROM 16:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 16" />
</usx>